icals, and scientific research.<\\/p><p>Specialty gases are rarely visible to the end customer, but essential industries cannot function without them. Helium is irreplaceable in medical MRI imaging, chip fabrication, and aerospace. The global supply chain, however, is concentrated and subject to price shocks.<\\/p><p>AirLife is building the sourcing, processing, and distribution capabilities needed to make this supply dependable.<\\/p>\",\"text_color\":\"#94A3B8\"},\"elements\":[]},{\"id\":\"4120b25\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"isInner\":false,\"widgetType\":\"button\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"Visit AirLife Gases \\u2197\",\"link\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/airlifegases.com\\/india\\/\",\"is_external\":\"\",\"nofollow\":\"\",\"custom_attributes\":\"\"},\"button_type\":\"default\",\"size\":\"sm\",\"border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"999\",\"right\":\"999\",\"bottom\":\"999\",\"left\":\"999\",\"isLinked\":true},\"background_color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"button_text_color\":\"#0E1113\"},\"elements\":[]}]}]}]},{\"id\":\"6fde587\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"isInner\":false,\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"boxed\",\"boxed_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":1260,\"sizes\":[]},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"85px\",\"right\":\"24\",\"bottom\":\"85px\",\"left\":\"24\",\"isLinked\":false},\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"9805989\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"isInner\":true,\"settings\":{\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100,\"sizes\":[]},\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_direction_tablet\":\"column\",\"gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":48,\"sizes\":[]},\"align_items\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"d0d9ca6\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"isInner\":true,\"settings\":{\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":52,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"af09a2b\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"isInner\":false,\"widgetType\":\"heading\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"SPACE TECHNOLOGY \\u00b7 LAUNCH VEHICLES\",\"header_size\":\"h6\",\"ali