}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"2f125c8\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":52,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"2fca9ce\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"ADVANCED COMPOSITES \\u00b7 AEROSPACE \\u00b7 DEFENCE\",\"header_size\":\"h6\",\"align\":\"left\",\"title_color\":\"#B88E44\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"13\",\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"0c38558\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Kineco\",\"align\":\"left\",\"typography_font_weight\":\"700\",\"title_color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"40\",\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"f0f53f6\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Building Advanced Materials for Demanding Industries\",\"header_size\":\"h4\",\"align\":\"left\",\"title_color\":\"#E2E8F0\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"20\",\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"13e9641\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Kineco designs and manufactures advanced composite products and assemblies for aerospace, defence, railways, and industrial applications.<\\/p><p>Composite manufacturing is a specialised business. Customers depend on precision, consistency, and the ability to meet demanding technical standards. Developing these capabilities takes years of expertise and sustained investment.<\\/p><p>Kineco has built advanced manufacturing infrastructure in India and established relationships across industries where supplier qualification matters enormously. Aerospace and defence manufacturing are expanding rapidly in India, and companies capable of delivering high-value components will play an important role in that growth.<\\/p>\",\"text_color\":\"#94A3B8\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"279940b\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"Visit Kineco \\u2197\",\"link\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.kinecogroup.com\\/\",\"is_external\":\"\",\"nofollow\":\"\",\"custom_attributes\":\"\"},\"button_type\":\"default\",\"border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"999\",\"right\":\"999\",\"bottom\":\"999\",\"left\":\"999\",\"isLinked\":true},\"background_color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"button_text_color\":\"#0E1113\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"button\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"8572959\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"boxed_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":1260,\"sizes\":[]},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"85px\",\"right\":\"24\",\"bottom\":\"85px\",\"left\":\"24\",\"isLinked\":false},\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_color\":\"#F4F4F2\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"27e72a0\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100,\"sizes\":[]},\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_direction_tablet\":\"column\",\"gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":48,\"sizes\":[]},\"align_items\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"5614435\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":52,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"3679d5c\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"NUCLEAR ENERGY \\u00b7 HEAVY ENGINEERING\",\"header_size\":\"h6\",\"align\":\"left\",\"title_color\":\"#B88E44\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"13\",\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"49b6957\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"CORE Energy\",\"align\":\"left\",\"typography_font_weight\":\"700\",\"title_color\":\"#0E1113\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"40\",\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"8945b7b\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Engineering for India\'s Nuclear Power Future\",\"header_size\":\"h4\",\"align\":\"left\",\"title_color\":\"#4A5056\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"20\",\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"7b6069e\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>CORE Energy Systems provides specialised engineering, manufacturing, and project-execution services across nuclear energy, defence, and critical power industries.<\\/p><p>Nuclear energy is one of the most technically demanding sectors in the world. The barriers to entry are high, qualification cycles are long, and there is zero room for error. Success requires engineering depth, regulatory understanding, and the ability to execute complex projects over extended periods.<\\/p><p>As electricity demand rises, India will need dependable sources of low-carbon baseload power while manufacturing more critical energy equipment domestically. CORE sits at the meeting point of these shifts.<\\/p>\",\"text_color\":\"#4A5056\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"129d564\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"Visit CORE Energy \\u2197\",\"link\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/core.co.in\\/\",\"is_external\":\"\",\"nofollow\":\"\",\"custom_attributes\":\"\"},\"button_type\":\"default\",\"border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"999\",\"right\":\"999\",\"bottom\":\"999\",\"left\":\"999\",\"isLinked\":true},\"background_color\":\"#0E1113\",\"button_text_color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"button\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"779da9c\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":48,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"48dbfe8\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/wordpress\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/gdas\\/core-energy.jpg\",\"id\":987685,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"image_size\":\"full\",\"border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":12,\"right\":12,\"bottom\":12,\"left\":12,\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"4fb5a4f\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"boxed_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":1260,\"sizes\":[]},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"85px\",\"right\":\"24\",\"bottom\":\"85px\",\"left\":\"24\",\"isLinked\":false},\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_color\":\"#0E1113\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"557bef9\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100,\"sizes\":[]},\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_direction_tablet\":\"column\",\"gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":48,\"sizes\":[]},\"align_items\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"6370812\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":48,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"2539a59\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/wordpress\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/gdas\\/airlife-gases.jpg\",\"id\":987686,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"image_size\":\"full\",\"border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":12,\"right\":12,\"bottom\":12,\"left\":12,\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"6273d3b\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":52,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"1d72ef5\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"SPECIALTY GASES \\u00b7 INFRASTRUCTURE\",\"header_size\":\"h6\",\"align\":\"left\",\"title_color\":\"#B88E44\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"13\",\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"7ab287b\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"AirLife Gases\",\"align\":\"left\",\"typography_font_weight\":\"700\",\"title_color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"40\",\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"e0b8f3d\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Securing the Gases That Critical Industries Depend On\",\"header_size\":\"h4\",\"align\":\"left\",\"title_color\":\"#E2E8F0\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"20\",\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"4806815\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>AirLife supplies helium and other high-purity specialty gases used across healthcare, semiconductor manufacturing, aerospace, pharmaceuticals, and scientific research.<\\/p><p>Specialty gases are rarely visible to the end customer, but essential industries cannot function without them. Helium is irreplaceable in medical MRI imaging, chip fabrication, and aerospace. The global supply chain, however, is concentrated and subject to price shocks.<\\/p><p>AirLife is building the sourcing, processing, and distribution capabilities needed to make this supply dependable.<\\/p>\",\"text_color\":\"#94A3B8\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"4120b25\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"Visit AirLife Gases \\u2197\",\"link\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/airlifegases.com\\/india\\/\",\"is_external\":\"\",\"nofollow\":\"\",\"custom_attributes\":\"\"},\"button_type\":\"default\",\"border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"999\",\"right\":\"999\",\"bottom\":\"999\",\"left\":\"999\",\"isLinked\":true},\"background_color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"button_text_color\":\"#0E1113\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"button\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"6fde587\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"boxed_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":1260,\"sizes\":[]},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"85px\",\"right\":\"24\",\"bottom\":\"85px\",\"left\":\"24\",\"isLinked\":false},\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"9805989\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100,\"sizes\":[]},\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_direction_tablet\":\"column\",\"gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":48,\"sizes\":[]},\"align_items\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"d0d9ca6\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":52,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"af09a2b\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"SPACE TECHNOLOGY \\u00b7 LAUNCH VEHICLES\",\"header_size\":\"h6\",\"align\":\"left\",\"title_color\":\"#B88E44\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"13\",\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"f0f57e8\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Agnikul Cosmos\",\"align\":\"left\",\"typography_font_weight\":\"700\",\"title_color\":\"#0E1113\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"40\",\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"1809fd8\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Expanding India\\u2019s Access to Space\",\"header_size\":\"h4\",\"align\":\"left\",\"title_color\":\"#4A5056\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"20\",\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"6d1ddce\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Agnikul is developing customizable orbital launch vehicles for small satellites, powered by proprietary 3D-printed rocket engines.<\\/p><p>Small-satellite operators often have to share larger rockets, accept fixed schedules, and compromise on orbital parameters. Agnikul\'s Agnibaan launch vehicle is designed to be configurable around individual payloads.<\\/p><p>The team crossed an important milestone by successfully flight-testing its semi-cryogenic engine from India\\u2019s first privately developed launchpad.<\\/p>\",\"text_color\":\"#4A5056\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"fb77679\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"Visit Agnikul \\u2197\",\"link\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/agnikul.in\\/\",\"is_external\":\"\",\"nofollow\":\"\",\"custom_attributes\":\"\"},\"button_type\":\"default\",\"border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"999\",\"right\":\"999\",\"bottom\":\"999\",\"left\":\"999\",\"isLinked\":true},\"background_color\":\"#0E1113\",\"button_text_color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"button\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"43ca50f\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":48,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"6839415\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/wordpress\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/gdas\\/agnikul.jpg\",\"id\":987687,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"image_size\":\"full\",\"border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":12,\"right\":12,\"bottom\":12,\"left\":12,\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false}]');
