:23:12','2023-10-26 17:23:12','<p>We like to do things our way, so don\'t expect the typical agency culture. At PixelPier, our multiple \"Best Places to Work\" awards are more than just accolades.</p>		\n			<a href=\"#jobs\">\n						WeΓÇÖre hiring\n					</a>\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.17.0 - 08-11-2023 */\n.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}</style><h6>Our services</h6>		\n			<h2>Everyone deserves an environment where they can thrive</h2>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.17.0 - 08-11-2023 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>												<img width=\"687\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/pexels-rfstudio-3810792-2-687x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/pexels-rfstudio-3810792-2-687x1024.jpg 687w, https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/pexels-rfstudio-3810792-2-201x300.jpg 201w, https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/pexels-rfstudio-3810792-2-768x1145.jpg 768w, https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/pexels-rfstudio-3810792-2.jpg 924w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 687px) 100vw, 687px\" />															\n			<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://pixelpiernyc.vamtam.com/wp-content/plugins/elementor/assets/css/widget-icon-list.min.css\">		<ul>\n							<li>\n										WeΓÇÖre collaborative\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n		<p>That\'s precisely why we emphasize collaborative problem-solving, providing unwavering support at every juncture. Our philosophy revolves around pushing boundaries, embracing errors as opportunities for growth, and using each project to continuously evolve ΓÇô essential elements for finding true fulfillment in your work.</p><p>At PixelPier, our primary focus is equipping you with the necessary tools to produce your finest work, all within a supportive framework that enables your success.</p>		\n															<img width=\"746\" height=\"642\" src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/annie-spratt-MChSQHxGZrQ-unsplash-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/annie-spratt-MChSQHxGZrQ-unsplash-1.jpg 746w, https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/annie-spratt-MChSQHxGZrQ-unsplash-1-300x258.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 746px) 100vw, 746px\" />															\n					<ul>\n							<li>\n										WeΓÇÖre technical\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n			<h6>PixelPier Life</h6>		\n			<h2>We firmly believe that building a solid team, fostering genuine collaboration, and creating a comfortable work environment extend far beyond the confines of the studio. To ensure this, we organize monthly team outings and bi-annual offsite events, actively promote vacation time, and observe summer Fridays with early log-offs at noon.</h2>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.17.0 - 08-11-2023 */\n.elementor-widget-image-carousel .swiper,.elementor-widget-image-carousel .swiper-container{position:static}.elementor-widget-image-carousel .swiper-container .swiper-slide figure,.elementor-widget-image-carousel .swiper .swiper-slide figure{line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-image-carousel .swiper-slide{text-align:center}.elementor-image-carousel-wrapper:not(.swiper-container-initialized):not(.swiper-initialized) .swiper-slide{max-width:calc(100% / var(--e-image-carousel-slides-to-show, 3))}</style>		\n								<figure><img src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/pexels-ivan-samkov-5428649-2048x1048.jpg\" alt=\"ΓÄ»   WeΓÇÖre creative\" /><figcaption>ΓÄ»   WeΓÇÖre creative</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/pexels-ivan-samkov-5428662-2048x1048.jpg\" alt=\"ΓÄ»   WeΓÇÖre imaginative\" /><figcaption>ΓÄ»   WeΓÇÖre imaginative</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/pexels-mart-production-7550298-3-2048x1048.jpg\" alt=\"ΓÄ»   WeΓÇÖre innovative\" /><figcaption>ΓÄ»   WeΓÇÖre innovative</figcaption></figure>			\n			<h6>Benefits</h6>		\n			<h3>We are always in search of great humans looking to grow</h3>		\n		<p>PixelPier takes pride in providing a competitive benefits and compensation package. However, we understand that a fulfilling job is more than just the numbers. Our goal is to cultivate an environment that our team members genuinely anticipate being a part of every single day.</p>		\n			<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" height=\"80\" viewBox=\"0 0 80 80\" width=\"80\"><path d=\"m22.3804155 57.6195845h16.8819456l-9.2691255 22.3804155h-15.2209158l-4.3283406-10.4435497-10.44354972-4.3241531v-15.2209159l22.38041552-9.2691254v16.8819455zm35.239169-35.239169h-16.8819456l9.2691255-22.3804155h15.2209158l4.3283406 10.4435497 10.4435497 4.3283406v15.2209158l-22.3804155 9.2691255zm-35.239169 0v16.8819456l-22.3804155-9.2691255v-15.2209158l10.4435497-4.3283406 4.3283406-10.44354972h15.2209158l9.2691255 22.38041552zm35.239169 35.239169v-16.8819456l22.3804155 9.2691255v15.2209158l-10.4435497 4.3241532-4.3283406 10.4435496h-15.2209158l-9.2691255-22.3804155h16.8819456z\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg>			\n					<ul>\n							<li>\n										Competitive salaries\n									</li>\n								<li>\n										Health, dental, and vision insurance\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n					<ul>\n							<li>\n										401(k) plan with matching\n									</li>\n								<li>\n										Generous paid time off program\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n					<ul>\n							<li>\n										Flexible ΓÇ£work from anywhereΓÇ¥ policy\n									</li>\n								<li>\n										Personal development stipend\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.17.0 - 08-11-2023 */\nbody.elementor-page .elementor-widget-menu-anchor{margin-bottom:0}</style>		\n			<h2>Current Openings</h2>','Careers','Work and life at PixelPier','publish','closed','closed','','careers','','','2023-10-26 17:23:12','2023-10-26 17:23:12','',0,'https://pixelpiernyc.vamtam.com/?page_id=1051',0,'page','',0),(1053,1,'2023-10-26 17:23:25','2023-10-26 17:23:25','<!-- Hero Banner (Dark Background) -->\n<section class=\"gdas-page-hero-dark\">\n    <div class=\"gdas-container\">\n        <div class=\"gdas-hero-content-box\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0;\">\n            <div class=\"gdas-eyebrow\">Get In Touch</div>\n            <h1 class=\"gdas-hero-title-main\">Building something that matters?</h1>\n            <p class=\"gdas-hero-subhead\">\n                We are always interested in meeting founders working on difficult, meaningful problems. Tell us what you are building, why it needs to exist, and why your team is the one to build it.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section><!-- Contact Info & Pitch Form -->\n<section class=\"gdas-contact-wrapper\">\n    <div class=\"gdas-container\">\n        <div class=\"gdas-story-grid\" style=\"align-items: start;\">\n            <div>\n                <div class=\"gdas-eyebrow\">Direct Conversation</div>\n                <h2 style=\"font-size: 2.4rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;\">Let\'s Talk Directly</h2>\n                <p style=\"font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--gdas-text-secondary); margin-bottom: 2rem;\">\n                    We don\'t make founders jump through hoops or pitch to junior analysts. If there is mutual alignment on conviction, problem depth, and defensibility, you speak directly with decision-makers.\n                </p>\n\n                <div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid var(--gdas-border); border-radius: var(--gdas-radius-md); padding: 2rem; box-shadow: var(--gdas-shadow-subtle);\">\n                    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\">\n                        <span style=\"font-size: 0.78rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: var(--gdas-gold); font-weight: 700; display: block; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;\">Direct Email</span>\n                        <a href=\"mailto:contact@gdasventures.com\" style=\"font-size: 1.2rem; color: var(--gdas-navy); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700;\">contact@gdasventures.com</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\">\n                        <span style=\"font-size: 0.78rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: var(--gdas-gold); font-weight: 700; display: block; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;\">Platform Model</span>\n                        <span style=\"font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--gdas-text-secondary); font-weight: 500;\">Private Investment Platform ┬╖ India</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <span style=\"font-size: 0.78rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: var(--gdas-gold); font-weight: 700; display: block; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;\">Network</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://linkedin.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--gdas-navy); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;\">LinkedIn Profile Γåù</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Founder Submission Form -->\n            <div class=\"gdas-contact-box\">\n                <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.75rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--gdas-navy);\">Introduce Your Company</h3>\n                <p style=\"font-size: 0.98rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; color: var(--gdas-text-muted);\">\n                    Fill in brief details below. We review every thoughtful submission.\n                </p>\n\n                <div id=\"gdas-form-msg\" class=\"gdas-form-msg\"></div>\n\n                <form id=\"gdas-pitch-form\" method=\"POST\">\n                    <div class=\"gdas-contact-grid\">\n                        <div class=\"gdas-form-field\">\n                            <label for=\"p-name\">Founder Name *</label>\n                            <input type=\"text\" id=\"p-name\" name=\"name\" class=\"gdas-input\" required placeholder=\"Your full name\">\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"gdas-form-field\">\n                            <label for=\"p-email\">Work Email *</label>\n                            <input type=\"email\" id=\"p-email\" name=\"email\" class=\"gdas-input\" required placeholder=\"founder@company.com\">\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"gdas-form-field\">\n                            <label for=\"p-company\">Company Name *</label>\n                            <input type=\"text\" id=\"p-company\" name=\"company\" class=\"gdas-input\" required placeholder=\"e.g. Acme Technologies\">\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"gdas-form-field\">\n                            <label for=\"p-website\">Company Website</label>\n                            <input type=\"url\" id=\"p-website\" name=\"website\" class=\"gdas-input\" placeholder=\"https://company.com\">\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"gdas-form-field\">\n                            <label for=\"p-sector\">Primary Domain</label>\n                            <select id=\"p-sector\" name=\"sector\" class=\"gdas-select\">\n                                <option value=\"Defence & Aerospace\">Defence & Aerospace</option>\n                                <option value=\"Advanced Manufacturing\">Advanced Manufacturing</option>\n                                <option value=\"Energy & Nuclear\">Energy & Nuclear</option>\n                                <option value=\"Specialty Gases & Infrastructure\">Specialty Gases & Infrastructure</option>\n                                <option value=\"Space Technology\">Space Technology</option>\n                                <option value=\"Semiconductors & Hardware\">Semiconductors & Hardware</option>\n                                <option value=\"Healthcare & Deeptech\">Healthcare & Deeptech</option>\n                                <option value=\"Bharat-Focused\">Bharat-Focused</option>\n                                <option value=\"Other\">Other Critical Domain</option>\n                            </select>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"gdas-form-field\">\n                            <label for=\"p-stage\">Current Stage</label>\n                            <select id=\"p-stage\" name=\"stage\" class=\"gdas-select\">\n                                <option value=\"R&D / Pre-Seed\">R&D / Pre-Seed</option>\n                                <option value=\"Seed\">Seed</option>\n                                <option value=\"Series A\">Series A</option>\n                                <option value=\"Growth / Later\">Growth / Later</option>\n                            </select>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"gdas-form-field col-full\">\n                            <label for=\"p-details\">What are you building? *</label>\n                            <textarea id=\"p-details\" name=\"pitch\" class=\"gdas-textarea\" required placeholder=\"Briefly describe what problem you are solving, your technological moat, and key milestones achieved.\"></textarea>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"gdas-form-field col-full\">\n                            <label for=\"p-deck\">Pitch Deck / Memo Link (Google Drive, DocSend)</label>\n                            <input type=\"url\" id=\"p-deck\" name=\"deck\" class=\"gdas-input\" placeholder=\"https://docsend.com/view/example\">\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"col-full\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem;\">\n                            <button type=\"submit\" class=\"gdas-btn gdas-btn-dark\" style=\"width: 100%; padding: 1rem;\">\n                                <span>Submit Introduction</span>\n                                <span class=\"gdas-btn-icon\">ΓåÆ</span>\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </form>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>','Contact','Let\'s build something great','publish','closed','closed','','contact','','','2026-09-03 06:41:26','2026-09-03 06:41:26','',0,'https://pixelpiernyc.vamtam.com/?page_id=1053',0,'page','',0),(1230,1,'2023-10-27 10:41:48','2023-10-27 10:41:48','<style>/*! elementor - v3.18.0 - 08-12-2023 */\nbody.elementor-page .elementor-widget-menu-anchor{margin-bottom:0}</style>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.18.0 - 08-12-2023 */\n.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}</style><h6>Award-Winning  Design</h6>		\n			<h3>Whether crafting an internal presentation or orchestrating a comprehensive rebranding initiative, our primary focus is creating solution-driven, visually captivating pieces in graphic design. Design is at the heart of everything we do.</h3>		\n			<a role=\"button\">\n						Art Direction\n					</a>\n			<a role=\"button\">\n						Packaging\n					</a>\n			<a role=\"button\">\n						Brand Guideline\n					</a>\n			<a role=\"button\">\n						Logo & Trademark\n					</a>\n			<a role=\"button\">\n						Branding Identity \n					</a>\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.18.0 - 08-12-2023 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>												<img width=\"2962\" height=\"1392\" src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Design.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Design.jpg 2962w, https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Design-300x141.jpg 300w, https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Design-1024x481.jpg 1024w, https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Design-768x361.jpg 768w, https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Design-1536x722.jpg 1536w, https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Design-2048x962.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2962px) 100vw, 2962px\" />															\n			<h6>Brand Strategy</h6>		\n			<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" height=\"76\" viewBox=\"0 0 76 76\" width=\"76\"><path d=\"m56.4364336 5.42982108 9.2646682 5.34888982c.1575985.0912985.2554183.2597659.2554183.4423628l-.00052