ay, Sculpting Emotions</h2>		\n			<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://pixelpiernyc.vamtam.com/wp-content/plugins/elementor/assets/css/widget-icon-list.min.css\">		<ul>\n							<li>\n										 Julia Clark\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n			<a role=\"button\">\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"374\" height=\"560\" src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/pexels-photo-3692056.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/pexels-photo-3692056.jpg 374w, https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/pexels-photo-3692056-200x300.jpg 200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 374px) 100vw, 374px\" />													\n													<img width=\"681\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/pexels-photo-6598660-681x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/pexels-photo-6598660-681x1024.jpg 681w, https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/pexels-photo-6598660-199x300.jpg 199w, https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/pexels-photo-6598660.jpg 726w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 681px) 100vw, 681px\" />													\n			<h2>ARTISTS</h2>		\n			<h2>EDITORIAL</h2>		\n			<a role=\"button\">\n						Read all articles\n					</a>\n			<h2>ABOUT</h2>		\n			<h3>We work closely with artists, guiding them through the selection and promotion process. </h3>		\n		<p>Also strategize, organize exhibitions and sales, and plan for the future. Our publishing house creates supplementary materials to amplify the societal importance of our artists\' work. Represent artists who have made significant contributions to culture and strive to showcase their art in esteemed institutions.</p>		\n													<img width=\"789\" height=\"526\" src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/pexels-ketut-subiyanto-4349939.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/pexels-ketut-subiyanto-4349939.jpg 789w, https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/pexels-ketut-subiyanto-4349939-300x200.jpg 300w, https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/pexels-ketut-subiyanto-4349939-768x512.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 789px) 100vw, 789px\" />													\n			<h3>History</h3>		\n		<p>Established in 2016, N├║ria Pelayo has been a haven for art enthusiasts, committed to promoting and celebrating exceptional talent across all mediums.</p>		\n													<img width=\"790\" height=\"526\" src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/pexels-lil-artsy-5541019.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/pexels-lil-artsy-5541019.jpg 790w, https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/pexels-lil-artsy-5541019-300x200.jpg 300w, https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/pexels-lil-artsy-5541019-768x511.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 790px) 100vw, 790px\" />													\n			<h3>Mission</h3>		\n		<p>Our mission is to create a dynamic space that fosters creativity, encourages dialogue, and brings the transformative power of art to the</p>		\n			<h2>Where art sparks minds and connects to beauty.</h2>		\n			<h2>CONTACT</h2>		\n			<h5>Drop a mesage</h5>		\n										<figure>\n											<a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/3Ds9BXBpQnz9DZFB6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\n							<img width=\"270\" height=\"404\" src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/pexels-ketut-subiyanto-4349753-cut.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/pexels-ketut-subiyanto-4349753-cut.jpg 270w, https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/pexels-ketut-subiyanto-4349753-cut-200x300.jpg 200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 270px) 100vw, 270px\" />								</a>\n											<figcaption>Seventh Ave 7,   New York City, NY</figcaption>\n										</figure>\n			<h5>LetΓÇÖs talk art</h5>		\n			<a role=\"button\">\n						1-800-356-8933\n					</a>\n			<a role=\"button\">\n						art@domain.com\n					</a>\n			<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n						Fb\n					</a>\n			<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n						In\n					</a>\n			<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n						Yt\n					</a>','Horizontal Layout','','publish','closed','closed','','horizontal-layout','','','2023-11-01 12:39:40','2023-11-01 12:39:40','',0,'https://pixelpiernyc.vamtam.com/?page_id=4604',0,'page','',0),(4868,1,'2023-11-23 19:31:40','2023-11-23 19:31:40','','Project]','','inherit','open','closed','','project','','','2023-11-23 19:31:40','2023-11-23 19:31:40','',0,'https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/Project.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(4904,1,'2023-11-23 19:41:53','2023-11-23 19:41:53','','Portfolio Loop - H. Branding Agency','','publish','closed','closed','','portfolio-loop-h-branding-agency','','','2023-11-23 19:41:53','2023-11-23 19:41:53','',0,'https://pixelpiernyc.vamtam.com/?post_type=elementor_library&amp;p=4904',0,'elementor_library','',0),(4907,1,'2023-11-23 19:50:19','2023-11-23 19:50:19','','1','','inherit','open','closed','','1','','','2023-11-23 19:50:19','2023-11-23 19:50:19','',0,'https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/1.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(4908,1,'2023-11-23 19:50:32','2023-11-23 19:50:32','','GettyImages-1193048894','','inherit','open','closed','','gettyimages-1193048894','','','2023-11-23 19:50:32','2023-11-23 19:50:32','',0,'https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/GettyImages-1193048894.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(4909,1,'2023-11-23 19