ubiyanto-5056090-2048x1040.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2800px) 100vw, 2800px\" />															\n			<h6>Challenge</h6>		\n			<h2>Our client needed a brand refresh to better reflect their evolving business values and appeal to a younger demographic.</h2>		\n		<p>In response to the dynamic shifts in their industry landscape and a desire to connect more effectively with a younger audience, our client recognized the imperative for a comprehensive brand refresh.</p><p>Driven by a commitment to remaining current, aligning with contemporary values, and resonating authentically with a dynamic audience, the refresh encompassed a holistic approach ΓÇö from visual aesthetics and messaging to a profound reimagining of the overall brand experience.</p>		\n															<img width=\"900\" height=\"666\" src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/monica-di-loxley-36RXyUGq_fU-unsplash.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/monica-di-loxley-36RXyUGq_fU-unsplash.jpg 900w, https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/monica-di-loxley-36RXyUGq_fU-unsplash-300x222.jpg 300w, https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/monica-di-loxley-36RXyUGq_fU-unsplash-768x568.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px\" />															\n			<h6>Goal</h6>		\n			<h2>We did some intense market research, refined their brand message, and created a brand new look to truly showcase their identity.</h2>		\n		Armed with insights, we meticulously refined their brand message for authenticity and resonance. Beyond words, we embarked on a creative journey, crafting a fresh visual identity that truly showcases their unique essence. This integrated approach, blending refined messaging and a captivating visual aesthetic, empowers our client to confidently communicate their values and engage their audience in a meaningful way.		\n															<img width=\"1000\" height=\"1380\" src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/cat-han-PfSGnSeBK4E-unsplash.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/cat-han-PfSGnSeBK4E-unsplash.jpg 1000w, https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/cat-han-PfSGnSeBK4E-unsplash-217x300.jpg 217w, https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/cat-han-PfSGnSeBK4E-unsplash-742x1024.jpg 742w, https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/cat-han-PfSGnSeBK4E-unsplash-768x1060.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" />															\n			<h6>Result</h6>		\n			<h2>The rebranded company experienced increased customer engagement, a boost in sales, and a stronger brand presence in the market.</h2>		\n		<p>The comprehensive initiative, extending beyond visual changes, resonated authentically with the audience, resulting in heightened engagement metrics and a tangible boost in sales. The company now stands on a more robust foundation, embodying a stronger and more compelling brand presence, setting the stage for continued success in the competitive market.</p>		\n			<h3>Bringing back visitors to the world of craft beer! Such an exciting journey!</h3>		\n															<img width=\"800\" height=\"1000\" src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/steve-cancel-ybxexK6umlM-unsplash.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/steve-cancel-ybxexK6umlM-unsplash.jpg 800w, https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/steve-cancel-ybxexK6umlM-unsplash-240x300.jpg 240w, https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/steve-cancel-ybxexK6umlM-unsplash-768x960.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />															\n															<img width=\"1536\" height=\"1023\" src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/studio-blackthorns-XpPNzr_ZeRk-unsplash-1536x1023.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/studio-blackthorns-XpPNzr_ZeRk-unsplash-1536x1023.jpg 1536w, https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/studio-blackthorns-XpPNzr_ZeRk-unsplash-300x200.jpg 300w, https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/studio-blackthorns-XpPNzr_ZeRk-unsplash-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/studio-blackthorns-XpPNzr_ZeRk-unsplash-768x512.jpg 768w, https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/studio-blackthorns-XpPNzr_ZeRk-unsplash.jpg 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1536px) 100vw, 1536px\" />															\n			<h3>Bringing back visitors to the world of craft beer! Such an exciting journey!</h3>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.18.0 - 04-12-2023 */\n.elementor-widget-image-carousel .swiper,.elementor-widget-image-carousel .swiper-container{position:static}.elementor-widget-image-carousel .swiper-container .swiper-slide figure,.elementor-widget-image-carousel .swiper .swiper-slide figure{line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-image-carousel .swiper-slide{text-align:center}.elementor-image-carousel-wrapper:not(.swiper-container-initialized):not(.swiper-initialized) .swiper-slide{max-width:calc(100% / var(--e-image-carousel-slides-to-show, 3))}</style>		\n								<figure><img src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/studio-blackthorns-Om6SV-Pg31k-unsplash-2048x1365.jpg\" alt=\"studio-blackthorns-Om6SV-Pg31k-unsplash\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/studio-blackthorns-m6sUTVAjl5o-unsplash-2048x1365.jpg\" alt=\"studio-blackthorns-m6sUTVAjl5o-unsplash\" /></figure>			\n			<h6>Next project</h6>','Portf