ight=\"1000\" src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/paul-blenkhorn-84767CQrS8-unsplash.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure>The Goethe <p>Acrylic on Canvas\n<br />\n52\" x 96\"</p>		\n			<figure><img width=\"700\" height=\"700\" src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/orfeas-green-G5A5ZNjS2tE-unsplash.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure>Cahier <p>Acrylic on Canvas\n<br />\n60\"x 40\"</p>		\n			<figure><img width=\"700\" height=\"1000\" src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/birmingham-museums-trust-5ruS8plfbvM-unsplash-e1702086643474.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure>Into Nature<p>Acrylic on canvas\n<br />\n40\" x 36\"</p>		\n			<figure><img width=\"700\" height=\"700\" src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/steve-johnson-b5HMwgoU2h4-unsplash.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure>Carolle<p>Oil on canvas\n<br />\n96\" x 60\"</p>		\n			<figure><img width=\"700\" height=\"1000\" src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/fuu-j-Lo7venJ_ywM-unsplash.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure>Dreamer<p>Acrylic on Canvas\n<br />\n40\" x 36\"</p>		\n			<figure><img width=\"700\" height=\"700\" src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/birmingham-museums-trust-BqaF65lS6E4-unsplash.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure>Inception <p>Acrylic on Canvas\n<br />\n121.92 ├ù 91.44 cm</p>','Shinzo Akihiko','Eloquent portraits capturing the essence of diverse beauty.','publish','closed','closed','','shinzo-akihiko','','','2023-12-05 05:20:24','2023-12-05 05:20:24','',4604,'https://pixelpiernyc.vamtam.com/?page_id=15864',0,'page','',0),(15865,1,'2023-12-08 21:58:04','2023-12-08 21:58:04','','pexels-cottonbro-studio-8091626','','inherit','','closed','','pexels-cottonbro-studio-8091626','','','2023-12-08 21:58:04','2023-12-08 21:58:04','',