e-height:1;display:block;height:.6em}.elementor-blockquote--skin-quotation .elementor-blockquote__content{margin-top:15px}.elementor-blockquote--align-left .elementor-blockquote__content{text-align:left}.elementor-blockquote--align-left .elementor-blockquote .e-q-footer{flex-direction:row}.elementor-blockquote--align-right .elementor-blockquote__content{text-align:right}.elementor-blockquote--align-right .elementor-blockquote .e-q-footer{flex-direction:row-reverse}.elementor-blockquote--align-center .elementor-blockquote{text-align:center}.elementor-blockquote--align-center .elementor-blockquote .e-q-footer,.elementor-blockquote--align-center .elementor-blockquote__author{display:block}.elementor-blockquote--align-center .elementor-blockquote__tweet-button{margin-right:auto;margin-left:auto}</style>		<blockquote>\n			<p>\n				ΓÇ£Brush up on colors and their associated emotions to make sure you nail the mood and tone of your brand.ΓÇ¥			</p>\n																<a href=\"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%E2%80%9CBrush+up+on+colors+and+their+associated+emotions+to+make+sure+you+nail+the+mood+and+tone+of+your+brand.%E2%80%9D&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fpixelpiernyc.vamtam.com%2Fwp-admin%2Fadmin-ajax.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n																																Tweet\n																												</a>\n					</blockquote>\n			<h4>Simple maximalism</h4>		\n		<p>You donΓÇÖt need to go down a design rabbit hole to create a brand that stands out. A bold font, a striking color palette, and mindful use of negative space are enough.</p><p>Choose one design element, like a font or color palette, and make it striking! Try balancing the simplicity of a serif font with a clashing color palette of electric blue, neon green, and yellow. Or, you could use a large, bold display font with a muted pink and blue palette.</p><p>In 2023, brands opt for simple elements that pack a punch to get their message across. This branding trend rose from the need for simplicity and structure without sacrificing creativity.</p><p>ItΓÇÖs a modern look and suits up-and-coming brands that offer a unique product or service. Or for businesses that want to stand out from a loud and crowded market.</p>','Blog Post Single - Page Content','','publish','closed','closed','','blog-post-single-page-content','','','2023-12-11 11:50:05','2023-12-11 11:50:05','',0,'https://pixelpiernyc.vamtam.com/?elementor_library=blog-post-single-page-content',0,'elementor_library','',0),(16502,1,'2023-12-11 13:02:04','2023-12-11 13:02:04','<style>/*! elementor - v3.18.0 - 08-12-2023 */\n.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}</style><h2>Cheers to breaking conventions, embracing flavor, and raising a glass to the art of brewing. \nElevate your palate!  </h2>		\n			<h6>Services</h6>		\n			<h6>Client</h6>		\n			Beyond Brewery		\n			<h6>Year</h6>		\n			2022		\n			<h6>Website</h6>		\n			<a href=\"https://vamtam.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n						flowcrafts.com\n					</a>\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.18.0 - 08-12-2023 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>												<img width=\"2956\" height=\"1400\" src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/mk-2-gwNAgJqeAUo-unsplash.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/mk-2-gwNAgJqeAUo-unsplash.jpg 2956w, https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/mk-2-gwNAgJqeAUo-unsplash-300x142.jpg 300w, https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/mk-2-gwNAgJqeAUo-unsplash-1024x485.jpg 1024w, https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/mk-2-gwNAgJqeAUo-unsplash-768x364.jpg 768w, https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/mk-2-gwNAgJqeAUo-unsplash-1536x727.jpg 1536w, https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/mk-2-gwNAgJqeAUo-unsplash-2048x970.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2956px) 100vw, 2956px\" />															\n			<h6>Challenge</h6>		\n			<h2>Our client needed a brand refresh to better reflect their evolving business values and appeal to a younger demographic.</h2>		\n		<p>In response to the dynamic shifts in their industry landscape and a desire to connect more effectively with a younger audience, our client recognized the imperative for a comprehensive brand refresh.</p><p>Driven by a commitment to remaining current, aligning with contemporary values, and resonating authentically with a dynamic audience, the refresh encompassed a holistic approach ΓÇö from visual aesthetics and messaging to a profound reimagining of the overall brand experience.</p>		\n															<img width=\"954\" height=\"762\" src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/photo-1633533450371-4d3562ca227f.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/photo-1633533450371-4d3562ca227f.jpg 954w, https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/photo-1633533450371-4d3562ca227f-300x240.jpg 300w, https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/photo-1633533450371-4d3562ca227f-768x613.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 954px) 100vw, 954px\" />															\n			<h6>Goal</h6>		\n			<h2>We did some intense market research, refined their brand message, and created a brand new look to truly showcase their identity.</h2>		\n		Armed with insights, we meticulously refined their brand message for authenticity and resonance. Beyond words, we embarked on a creative journey, crafting a fresh visual identity that truly showcases their unique essence. This integrated approach, blending refined messaging and a captivating visual aesthetic, empowers our client to confidently communicate their values and engage their audience in a meaningful way.		\n															<img width=\"800\" height=\"1104\" src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/mk-2-wG6qTlEBMM8-unsplash.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/mk-2-wG6qTlEBMM8-unsplash.jpg 800w, https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/mk-2-wG6qTlEBMM8-unsplash-217x300.jpg 217w, https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/mk-2-wG6qTlEBMM8-unsplash-742x1024.jpg 742w, https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/mk-2-wG6qTlEBMM8-unsplash-768x1060.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />															\n			<h6>Result</h6>		\n			<h2>The rebranded company experienced increased customer engagement, a boost in sales, and a stronger brand presence in the market.</h2>		\n		<p>The comprehensive initiative, extending beyond visual changes, resonated authentically with the audience, resulting in heightened engagement metrics and a tangible boost in sales. The company now stands on a more robust foundation, embodying a stronger and more compelling brand presence, setting the stage for continued success in the competitive market.</p>		\n			<h3>We excel in crafting distinctive brands that set themselves apart from the competition.</h3>		\n															<img width=\"952\" height=\"1456\" src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/mk-2-XoiBIpYkPJA-unsplash.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/mk-2-XoiBIpYkPJA-unsplash.jpg 952w, https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/mk-2-XoiBIpYkPJA-unsplash-196x300.jpg 196w, https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/mk-2-XoiBIpYkPJA-unsplash-670x1024.jpg 670w, https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/mk-2-XoiBIpYkPJA-unsplash-768x1175.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 952px) 100vw, 952px\" />															\n															<img width=\"1536\" height=\"1023\" src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/mk-2-ypeZtZBUW6E-unsplash-1536x1023.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/mk-2-ypeZtZBUW6E-unsplash-1536x1023.jpg 1536w, https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/mk-2-ypeZtZBUW6E-unsplash-300x200.jpg 300w, https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/mk-2-ypeZtZBUW6E-unsplash-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/mk-2-ypeZtZBUW6E-unsplash-768x512.jpg 768w, https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/mk-2-ypeZtZBUW6E-unsplash.jpg 1672w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1536px) 100vw, 1536px\" />															\n			<h3>We excel in crafting distinctive brands that set themselves apart from the competition.</h3>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.18.0 - 08-12-2023 */\n.elementor-widget-image-carousel .swiper,.elementor-widget-image-carousel .swiper-container{position:static}.elementor-widget-image-carousel .swiper-container .swiper-slide figure,.elementor-widget-image-carousel .swiper .swiper-slide figure{line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-image-carousel .swiper-slide{