     <div class=\"gdas-slide-badge\">\n                        <span class=\"dot\"></span>\n                        <span>Private Investment Platform</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <h1 class=\"gdas-slide-title\">\n                        Backing the founders building India\'s <span class=\"accent\">industrial backbone.</span>\n                    </h1>\n                    <p class=\"gdas-slide-desc\">\n                        We invest our own patient capital into ambitious Indian companies solving technically hard problems across aerospace, heavy engineering, nuclear energy, and space technology.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"gdas-slide-buttons\">\n                        <a href=\"/wordpress/investments/\" class=\"gdas-btn gdas-btn-dark\">\n                            <span>Explore Our Investments</span>\n                            <span class=\"gdas-btn-icon\">Γåù</span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"/wordpress/contact/\" class=\"gdas-btn gdas-btn-white\">\n                            <span>Introduce Your Company</span>\n                            <span class=\"gdas-btn-icon\">ΓåÆ</span>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Slide 2: Kineco -->\n        <div class=\"gdas-slide\" data-slide=\"1\">\n            <img src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/themes/pixelpiernyc-child/assets/images/kineco.jpg\" alt=\"Kineco Aerospace Composite Assembly\" class=\"gdas-slide-bg\" width=\"1600\" height=\"900\">\n            <div class=\"gdas-slide-overlay\"></div>\n            <div class=\"gdas-container\">\n                <div class=\"gdas-slide-content\">\n                    <div class=\"gdas-slide-badge\">\n                        <span class=\"dot\"></span>\n                        <span>Portfolio ┬╖ Aerospace & Defence</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <h2 class=\"gdas-slide-title\">\n                        Advanced composites engineered for <span class=\"accent\">sovereign flight.</span>\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"gdas-slide-desc\">\n                        Kineco builds mission-critical composite assemblies for aerospace, defence, and high-speed railΓÇöcapabilities requiring years of expertise, rigorous supplier qualification, and precision tooling.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"gdas-slide-buttons\">\n                        <a href=\"/wordpress/investments/#kineco\" class=\"gdas-btn gdas-btn-dark\">\n                            <span>Why We Invested in Kineco</span>\n                            <span class=\"gdas-btn-icon\">ΓåÆ</span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.kinecogroup.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"gdas-btn gdas-btn-white\">\n                            <span>kinecogroup.com</span>\n                            <span class=\"gdas-btn-icon\">Γåù</span>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Slide 3: CORE Energy -->\n        <div class=\"gdas-slide\" data-slide=\"2\">\n            <img src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/themes/pixelpiernyc-child/assets/images/core-energy.jpg\" alt=\"CORE Energy Nuclear Engineering Workshop\" class=\"gdas-slide-bg\" width=\"1600\" height=\"900\">\n            <div class=\"gdas-slide-overlay\"></div>\n            <div class=\"gdas-container\">\n                <div class=\"gdas-slide-content\">\n                    <div class=\"gdas-slide-badge\">\n                        <span class=\"dot\"></span>\n                        <span>Portfolio ┬╖ Nuclear Energy & Heavy Engineering</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <h2 class=\"gdas-slide-title\">\n                        Engineering IndiaΓÇÖs <span class=\"accent\">low-carbon baseload power.</span>\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"gdas-slide-desc\">\n                        CORE Energy Systems provides specialised equipment manufacturing and project execution across nuclear power and national defence, where barriers to entry are high and qualification cycles span years.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"gdas-slide-buttons\">\n                        <a href=\"/wordpress/investments/#core-energy\" class=\"gdas-btn gdas-btn-dark\">\n                            <span>Why We Invested in CORE</span>\n                            <span class=\"gdas-btn-icon\">ΓåÆ</span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://core.co.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"gdas-btn gdas-btn-white\">\n                            <span>core.co.in</span>\n                            <span class=\"gdas-btn-icon\">Γåù</span>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Slide 4: Agnikul Cosmos -->\n        <div class=\"gdas-slide\" data-slide=\"3\">\n            <img src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/themes/pixelpiernyc-child/assets/images/agnikul.jpg\" alt=\"Agnikul Aerospace Engineers & Rocket Engine\" class=\"gdas-slide-bg\" width=\"1600\" height=\"900\">\n            <div class=\"gdas-slide-overlay\"></div>\n            <div class=\"gdas-container\">\n                <div class=\"gdas-slide-content\">\n                    <div class=\"gdas-slide-badge\">\n                        <span class=\"dot\"></span>\n                        <span>Portfolio ┬╖ Space Technology</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <h2 class=\"gdas-slide-title\">\n                        Expanding India\'s flexible <span class=\"accent\">access to orbit.</span>\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"gdas-slide-desc\">\n                        Agnikul Cosmos is developing customizable launch vehicles powered by patented 3D-printed rocket engines, successfully flight-tested from India\'s first privately developed launchpad.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"gdas-slide-buttons\">\n                        <a href=\"/wordpress/investments/#agnikul\" class=\"gdas-btn gdas-btn-dark\">\n                            <span>Why We Invested in Agnikul</span>\n                            <span class=\"gdas-btn-icon\">ΓåÆ</span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://agnikul.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"gdas-btn gdas-btn-white\">\n                            <span>agnikul.in</span>\n                            <span class=\"gdas-btn-icon\">Γåù</span>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Slide 5: AirLife Gases -->\n        <div class=\"gdas-slide\" data-slide=\"4\">\n            <img src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/themes/pixelpiernyc-child/assets/images/airlife-gases.jpg\" alt=\"AirLife Specialty Gas Distribution\" class=\"gdas-slide-bg\" width=\"1600\" height=\"900\">\n            <div class=\"gdas-slide-overlay\"></div>\n            <div class=\"gdas-container\">\n                <div class=\"gdas-slide-content\">\n                    <div class=\"gdas-slide-badge\">\n                        <span class=\"dot\"></span>\n                        <span>Portfolio ┬╖ Critical Infrastructure</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <h2 class=\"gdas-slide-title\">\n                        Securing the gases that <span class=\"accent\">vital industries depend on.</span>\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"gdas-slide-desc\">\n                        AirLife supplies helium and high-purity gases indispensable for semiconductor chip fabrication, medical imaging, and aerospace researchΓÇömaking sovereign supply chains dependable.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"gdas-slide-buttons\">\n                        <a href=\"/wordpress/investments/#airlife\" class=\"gdas-btn gdas-btn-dark\">\n                            <span>Why We Invested in AirLife</span>\n                            <span class=\"gdas-btn-icon\">ΓåÆ</span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://airlifegases.com/india/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"gdas-btn gdas-btn-white\">\n                            <span>airlifegases.com</span>\n                            <span class=\"gdas-btn-icon\">Γåù</span>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Slider Bottom Controls: Dots & Navigation Arrows -->\n    <div class=\"gdas-slider-controls\">\n        <div class=\"gdas-container gdas-slider-controls-inner\">\n            <div class=\"gdas-slider-dots\">\n                <button class=\"gdas-dot active\" aria-label=\"Slide 1\">\n                    <span class=\"dot-bar\"></span>\n                    <span class=\"dot-text\">01 ┬╖ Platform</span>\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"gdas-dot\" aria-label=\"Slide 2\">\n                    <span class=\"dot-bar\"></span>\n                    <span class=\"dot-text\">02 ┬╖ Aerospace</span>\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"gdas-dot\" aria-label=\"Slide 3\">\n                    <span class=\"dot-bar\"></span>\n                    <span class=\"dot-text\">03 ┬╖ Nuclear</span>\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"gdas-dot\" aria-label=\"Slide 4\">\n                    <span class=\"dot-bar\"></span>\n                    <span class=\"dot-text\">04 ┬╖ Space</span>\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"gdas-dot\" aria-label=\"Slide 5\">\n                    <span class=\"dot-bar\"></span>\n                    <span class=\"dot-text\">05 ┬╖ Gases</span>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"gdas-slider-arrows\">\n                <button class=\"gdas-arrow-btn gdas-prev-slide\" aria-label=\"Previous Slide\">\n                    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M15 18l-6-6 6-6\"/></svg>\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"gdas-arrow-btn gdas-next-slide\" aria-label=\"Next Slide\">\n                    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M9 18l6-6-6-6\"/></svg>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- Trust Metric Bar -->\n<section class=\"gdas-slider-trust-bar\">\n    <div class=\"gdas-container\">\n        <div class=\"gdas-trust-bar\" style=\"margin-top: 0; padding-top: 0; border-top: none;\">\n            <div class=\"gdas-trust-item\">\n                <h4>Private Balance Sheet</h4>\n                <p>We deploy our own capital. No LP fund clocks, no artificial exit pressures.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"gdas-trust-item\">\n                <h4>Four Anchor Platforms</h4>\n                <p>High-conviction investments in Kineco, CORE Energy, AirLife Gases, and Agnikul.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"gdas-trust-item\">\n                <h4>10+ Year Horizon</h4>\n                <p>Patient partnership for businesses with complex engineering and long qualification cycles.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section><!-- 2. Our Thesis Narrative -->\n<section class=\"gdas-section-story\" style=\"background-color: #FFFFFF;\">\n    <div class=\"gdas-container\">\n        <div class=\"gdas-story-grid\">\n            <div>\n                <div class=\"gdas-eyebrow\">Our Thesis</div>\n                <h2 class=\"gdas-story-heading\">IndiaΓÇÖs next generation of companies will not be built only in software.</h2>\n                <div class=\"gdas-story-body\">\n                    <p>\n                        For years, Indian venture capital was largely understood through consumer internet, fintech, and software services. That era laid vital digital foundations, but India is ready for something substantially broader.\n                    </p>\n                    <p>\n                        The defining businesses of the next thirty years will be forged in workshops, precision machining bays, engineering centres, and launch facilities. They will strengthen how India manufactures, generates clean baseload energy, reaches orbit, and participates in global supply chains.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"gdas-story-quote\">\n                        \"These businesses take years to build. They solve technically hard problems and require founders willing to build before the market makes it obvious.\"\n                    </div>\n                    <p>\n                        These are the companies we back. We don\'t need consensus; we back founders with the technical grit to build enduring domestic capability.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"gdas-story-media-card\">\n                <img src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/themes/pixelpiernyc-child/assets/images/india-building.jpg\" alt=\"Authentic Materials Research Laboratory\" width=\"800\" height=\"550\">\n                <div class=\"gdas-story-media-badge\">\n                    Materials Science & Testing Laboratory\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section><!-- 3. Portfolio Companies Showcase (DEEP BLACK BACKGROUND - SPG Style) -->\n<section class=\"gdas-section-portfolio gdas-section-black\" id=\"portfolio\" style=\"padding: 6rem 0;\">\n    <div class=\"gdas-container\">\n        <div class=\"gdas-section-header\">\n            <div class=\"gdas-eyebrow\">Portfolio</div>\n            <h2>Companies We Have Backed</h2>\n            <p class=\"gdas-lede\">Every investment begins with conviction in a company, its founders, and what they are setting out to build.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"gdas-portfolio-grid\">\n            <!-- 1. Kineco -->\n            <div class=\"gdas-company-card dark-theme\">\n                <div class=\"gdas-company-media\">\n                    <img src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/themes/pixelpiernyc-child/assets/images/kineco.jpg\" alt=\"Kineco Aerospace Composite Manufacturing\" width=\"700\" height=\"440\">\n                    <span class=\"gdas-company-tag\">Aerospace & Defence</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"gdas-company-content\">\n                    <h3 class=\"gdas-company-title\">Kineco</h3>\n                    <div class=\"gdas-company-subhead\">Advanced Composites for Aerospace, Defence & Rail</div>\n                    <p class=\"gdas-company-desc\">\n                        Kineco designs and manufactures critical composite assemblies that must withstand extreme environments. Developing these capabilities requires years of domain expertise, stringent quality certifications, and capital discipline.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"gdas-company-actions\">\n                        <a href=\"/wordpress/investments/#kineco\" class=\"gdas-link-arrow\">\n                            Why We Invested <span>ΓåÆ</span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.kinecogroup.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"gdas-link-arrow\" style=\"color: #94A3B8;\">\n                            kinecogroup.com Γåù\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- 2. CORE Energy -->\n            <div class=\"gdas-company-card dark-theme\">\n                <div class=\"gdas-company-media\">\n                    <img src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/themes/pixelpiernyc-child/assets/images/core-energy.jpg\" alt=\"CORE Energy Nuclear Engineering Workshop\" width=\"700\" height=\"440\">\n                    <span class=\"gdas-company-tag\">Nuclear Energy ┬╖ Heavy Engineering</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"gdas-company-content\">\n                    <h3 class=\"gdas-company-title\">CORE Energy</h3>\n                    <div class=\"gdas-company-subhead\">Engineering for India\'s Nuclear Power Future</div>\n                    <p class=\"gdas-company-desc\">\n                        Providing specialised engineering and equipment manufacturing across nuclear energy and defence. In a sector with high barriers to entry and long qualification cycles, CORE sits at the intersection of rising baseload power demand and domestic manufacturing.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"gdas-company-actions\">\n                        <a href=\"/wordpress/investments/#core-energy\" class=\"gdas-link-arrow\">\n                            Why We Invested <span>ΓåÆ</span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://core.co.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"gdas-link-arrow\" style=\"color: #94A3B8;\">\n                            core.co.in Γåù\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- 3. AirLife Gases -->\n            <div class=\"gdas-company-card dark-theme\">\n                <div class=\"gdas-company-media\">\n                    <img src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/themes/pixelpiernyc-child/assets/images/airlife-gases.jpg\" alt=\"AirLife Specialty Gas Distribution\" width=\"700\" height=\"440\">\n                    <span class=\"gdas-company-tag\">Specialty Gases ┬╖ Infrastructure</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"gdas-company-content\">\n                    <h3 class=\"gdas-company-title\">AirLife Gases</h3>\n                    <div class=\"gdas-company-subhead\">Critical High-Purity Gas Supply Chains</div>\n                    <p class=\"gdas-company-desc\">\n                        Supplying helium and ultra-high-purity specialty gases required by semiconductor fabrication, medical MRI imaging, and aerospace. AirLife is building the domestic distribution and processing footprint to protect vital industries from supply interruptions.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"gdas-company-actions\">\n                        <a href=\"/wordpress/investments/#airlife\" class=\"gdas-link-arrow\">\n                            Why We Invested <span>ΓåÆ</span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://airlifegases.com/india/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"gdas-link-arrow\" style=\"color: #94A3B8;\">\n                            airlifegases.com Γåù\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- 4. Agnikul Cosmos -->\n            <div class=\"gdas-company-card dark-theme\">\n                <div class=\"gdas-company-media\">\n                    <img src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/themes/pixelpiernyc-child/assets/images/agnikul.jpg\" alt=\"Agnikul Aerospace Engineers & Rocket Propulsion\" width=\"700\" height=\"440\">\n                    <span class=\"gdas-company-tag\">Space Technology ┬╖ Launch Vehicles</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"gdas-company-content\">\n                    <h3 class=\"gdas-company-title\">Agnikul Cosmos</h3>\n                    <div class=\"gdas-company-subhead\">Flexible Orbital Launch Powered by 3D Printing</div>\n                    <p class=\"gdas-company-desc\">\n                        Developing customizable small-satellite launch vehicles powered by patented, single-piece 3D-printed rocket engines. Agnikul successfully flight-tested its semi-cryogenic engine from IndiaΓÇÖs first privately developed launchpad.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"gdas-company-actions\">\n                        <a href=\"/wordpress/investments/#agnikul\" class=\"gdas-link-arrow\">\n                            Why We Invested <span>ΓåÆ</span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://agnikul.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"gdas-link-arrow\" style=\"color: #94A3B8;\">\n                            agnikul.in Γåù\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section><!-- 4. What Earns Our Conviction (Warm Stone Background) -->\n<section class=\"gdas-section-framework\">\n    <div class=\"gdas-container\">\n        <div class=\"gdas-section-header text-center\">\n            <div class=\"gdas-eyebrow\">Our Underwriting</div>\n            <h2>What Earns Our Conviction</h2>\n            <p class=\"gdas-lede\">We care less about buzzwords or market trends, and more about whether you are solving an authentic, hard problem that creates lasting value.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"gdas-framework-grid\">\n            <div class=\"gdas-framework-card\">\n                <div class=\"gdas-framework-icon-wrap\">\n                    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M12 2a5 5 0 100 10 5 5 0 000-10zM4 21v-2a6 6 0 0112 0v2\"/></svg>\n                </div>\n                <h3>Founders who know the problem inside out</h3>\n                <p>We look for teams who have lived the friction firsthand. They understand customer constraints and know exactly why earlier solutions failed.</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"gdas-framework-card\">\n                <div class=\"gdas-framework-icon-wrap\">\n                    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"11\" width=\"18\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0110 0v4\"/></svg>\n                </div>\n                <h3>Something genuinely difficult to replicate</h3>\n                <p>We favor companies whose core capability cannot be duplicated with capital aloneΓÇöwhether protected by proprietary tech, manufacturing depth, or regulatory certifications.</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"gdas-framework-card\">\n                <div class=\"gdas-framework-icon-wrap\">\n                    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 11-5.93-9.14\"/><path d=\"M22 4L12 14.01l-3-3\"/></svg>\n                </div>\n                <h3>A real, urgent customer requirement</h3>\n                <p>The product must solve a critical pain point. We want to see why customers cannot operate without your solution today.</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"gdas-framework-card\">\n                <div class=\"gdas-framework-icon-wrap\">\n                    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><polyline points=\"22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12\"/></svg>\n                </div>\n                <h3>Tangible evidence that the market cares</h3>\n                <p>Validation can take many shapes: pilot programs, repeat purchase orders, technical qualification benchmarks, or customer prepayment.</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"gdas-framework-card\">\n                <div class=\"gdas-framework-icon-wrap\">\n                    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M16 8l-8 8M8 8l8 8\"/></svg>\n                </div>\n                <h3>Room to become meaningfully larger</h3>\n                <p>We invest in companies riding multi-decade macro tailwindsΓÇödomestic supply security, industrialization, and global supply chain rebalancing.</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"gdas-framework-card\">\n                <div class=\"gdas-framework-icon-wrap\">\n                    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"/></svg>\n                </div>\n                <h3>Thoughtful use of capital</h3>\n                <p>Capital should unlock concrete milestones. We back founders who know what they need to prove next and treat every rupee with respect.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section><!-- 5. Sectors Where We Back Builders (DEEP BLACK BACKGROUND - SPG Style) -->\n<section class=\"gdas-section-sectors gdas-section-black\" style=\"padding: 6rem 0;\">\n    <div class=\"gdas-container\">\n        <div class=\"gdas-section-header text-center\">\n            <div class=\"gdas-eyebrow\">Investment Focus</div>\n            <h2>Sector Agnostic. Thesis Driven.</h2>\n            <p class=\"gdas-lede\">We back companies across eight critical areas shaping India\'s economic sovereignty.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"gdas-sectors-grid\">\n            <div class=\"gdas-sector-pill-card dark-theme\">\n                <div class=\"gdas-sector-top\">\n                    <span class=\"gdas-sector-badge\">01</span>\n                    <div class=\"gdas-sector-icon\">\n                        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\"/></svg>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"gdas-sector-title\">Defence & Aerospace</div>\n                <p class=\"gdas-sector-desc\">Composites, avionics, unmanned aerial systems, and sovereign defence hardware.</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"gdas-sector-pill-card dark-theme\">\n                <div class=\"gdas-sector-top\">\n                    <span class=\"gdas-sector-badge\">02</span>\n                    <div class=\"gdas-sector-icon\">\n                        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M2 20h20M5 20V8l5 4V4l5 4v8M19 20v-6l-4-3\"/></svg>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"gdas-sector-title\">Advanced Manufacturing</div>\n                <p class=\"gdas-sector-desc\">Precision tooling, robotic fabrication, heavy metallurgy, and complex assembly.</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"gdas-sector-pill-card dark-theme\">\n                <div class=\"gdas-sector-top\">\n                    <span class=\"gdas-sector-badge\">03</span>\n                    <div class=\"gdas-sector-icon\">\n                        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z\"/></svg>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"gdas-sector-title\">Energy & Nuclear</div>\n                <p class=\"gdas-sector-desc\">Low-carbon baseload power, specialized reactor valves, and grid infrastructure.</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"gdas-sector-pill-card dark-theme\">\n                <div class=\"gdas-sector-top\">\n                    <span class=\"gdas-sector-badge\">04</span>\n                    <div class=\"gdas-sector-icon\">\n                        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"16\"/><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"12\"/></svg>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"gdas-sector-title\">Specialty Gases</div>\n                <p class=\"gdas-sector-desc\">Helium, argon, and high-purity gases critical for semiconductors, MRI, and space.</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"gdas-sector-pill-card dark-theme\">\n                <div class=\"gdas-sector-top\">\n                    <span class=\"gdas-sector-badge\">05</span>\n                    <div class=\"gdas-sector-icon\">\n                        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"/><path d=\"M19.4 15a1.65 1.65 0 00.33 1.82l.06.06a2 2 0 010 2.83 2 2 0 01-2.83 0l-.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 00-1.82-.33 1.65 1.65 0 00-1 1.51V21a2 2 0 01-2 2 2 2 0 01-2-2v-.09A1.65 1.65 0 009 19.4a1.65 1.65 0 00-1.82.33l-.06.06a2 2 0 01-2.83 0 2 2 0 010-2.83l.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 00.33-1.82 1.65 1.65 0 00-1.51-1H3a2 2 0 01-2-2 2 2 0 012-2h.09A1.65 1.65 0 004.6 9a1.65 1.65 0 00-.33-1.82l-.06-.06a2 2 0 010-2.83 2 2 0 012.83 0l.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 001.82.33H9a1.65 1.65 0 001-1.51V3a2 2 0 012-2 2 2 2 0 012 2v.09a1.65 1.65 0 001 1.51 1.65 1.65 0 001.82-.33l.06-.06a2 2 0 012.83 0 2 2 0 010 2.83l-.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 00-.33 1.82V9a1.65 1.65 0 001.51 1H21a2 2 0 012 2 2 2 0 01-2 2h-.09a1.65 1.65 0 00-1.51 1z\"/></svg>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"gdas-sector-title\">Deeptech & Space</div>\n                <p class=\"gdas-sector-desc\">Propulsion systems, small-satellite launch systems, optics, and additive manufacturing.</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"gdas-sector-pill-card dark-theme\">\n                <div class=\"gdas-sector-top\">\n                    <span class=\"gdas-sector-badge\">06</span>\n                    <div class=\"gdas-sector-icon\">\n                        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"7\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M16 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2h-4a2 2 0 00-2 2v16\"/></svg>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"gdas-sector-title\">Semiconductors</div>\n                <p class=\"gdas-sector-desc\">Testing, packaging, fab equipment components, and domestic electronic assemblies.</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"gdas-sector-pill-card dark-theme\">\n                <div class=\"gdas-sector-top\">\n                    <span class=\"gdas-sector-badge\">07</span>\n                    <div class=\"gdas-sector-icon\">\n                        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2\"/></svg>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"gdas-sector-title\">Healthcare Tech</div>\n                <p class=\"gdas-sector-desc\">Biomedical engineering, diagnostic hardware, medical imaging, and active ingredients.</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"gdas-sector-pill-card dark-theme\">\n                <div class=\"gdas-sector-top\">\n                    <span class=\"gdas-sector-badge\">08</span>\n                    <div class=\"gdas-sector-icon\">\n                        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"gdas-sector-title\">Bharat-Focused</div>\n                <p class=\"gdas-sector-desc\">Logistics, rural supply infrastructure, clean mobility, and productive industrial assets.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section><!-- 6. Interactive Founder FAQ Accordion (Warm Stone) -->\n<section class=\"gdas-section-faq\">\n    <div class=\"gdas-container\">\n        <div class=\"gdas-section-header text-center\">\n            <div class=\"gdas-eyebrow\">How We Work</div>\n            <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n            <p class=\"gdas-lede\">Direct answers for founders considering partnering with G Das Ventures.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"gdas-accordion\">\n            <div class=\"gdas-accordion-item active\">\n                <button class=\"gdas-accordion-header\">\n                    <span>How does a private investment platform differ from a standard VC fund?</span>\n                    <span class=\"gdas-accordion-icon\">+</span>\n                </button>\n                <div class=\"gdas-accordion-body\" style=\"max-height: 200px;\">\n                    <p>\n                        Institutional VC funds raise third-party money with a strict 7 to 10-year lifespan, forcing them to push for exits regardless of market conditions. We invest our own balance sheet. We answer to no external LP committees, meaning we can hold investments for 10, 15, or 20 years if it allows the business to reach its full potential.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"gdas-accordion-item\">\n                <button class=\"gdas-accordion-header\">\n                    <span>What stage of companies do you back?</span>\n                    <span class=\"gdas-accordion-icon\">+</span>\n                </button>\n                <div class=\"gdas-accordion-body\">\n                    <p>\n                        We are stage-flexible. What matters is not whether you are pre-revenue or scaling, but whether you have genuine technical depth, defensibility, and a clear path toward building valuable physical or industrial infrastructure.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"gdas-accordion-item\">\n                <button class=\"gdas-accordion-header\">\n                    <span>How do you support companies beyond capital?</span>\n                    <span class=\"gdas-accordion-icon\">+</span>\n                </button>\n                <div class=\"gdas-accordion-body\">\n                    <p>\n                        We actively help portfolio companies with industrial supplier qualification, customer introductions in demanding sectors like aerospace and energy, regulatory guidance, and navigating government procurement channels.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"gdas-accordion-item\">\n                <button class=\"gdas-accordion-header\">\n                    <span>What does the pitch process look like?</span>\n                    <span class=\"gdas-accordion-icon\">+</span>\n                </button>\n                <div class=\"gdas-accordion-body\">\n                    <p>\n                        Our feedback loop is fast and direct. When you submit through our contact form or reach out, you talk directly with the decision-makers. There are no junior analyst filters. If there is mutual alignment, we schedule a technical deep-dive.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section><!-- 7. High-Impact Call to Action Banner (DEEP BLACK BACKGROUND) -->\n<section class=\"gdas-cta-banner\">\n    <div class=\"gdas-container\">\n        <div class=\"eyebrow-light\">Our Commitment</div>\n        <h2>India has no shortage of important problems to solve. We want to back the people choosing to solve them.</h2>\n        <p>If you\'re building in advanced manufacturing, deeptech, energy, or space, we\'d love to hear what you\'re working on.</p>\n        <div class=\"gdas-creed-badge\">\n            <span>For profit.</span>\n            <span>For good.</span>\n            <span>For India.</span>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n            <a href=\"/wordpress/contact/\" class=\"gdas-btn gdas-btn-gold\">\n                <span>Introduce Your Company</span>\n                <span class=\"gdas-btn-icon\">ΓåÆ</span>\n            </a>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','987657-revision-v1','','','2026-09-03 06:41:25','2026-09-03 06:41:25','',987657,'https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/?p=987677',0,'revision','',0),(987678,1,'2026-09-03 06:41:25','2026-09-03 06:41:25','<!-- Hero Banner (Dark Background) -->\n<section class=\"gdas-page-hero-dark\">\n    <div class=\"gdas-container\">\n        <div class=\"gdas-hero-content-box\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0;\">\n            <div class=\"gdas-eyebrow\">Portfolio</div>\n            <h1 class=\"gdas-hero-title-main\">Companies We Have Backed</h1>\n            <p class=\"gdas-hero-subhead\">\n                Every investment begins with conviction in a company, its founders, and what they are setting out to build. Here is why we backed each of them.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section><!-- Kineco Deep Dive (DEEP BLACK BACKGROUND) -->\n<section class=\"gdas-section-black\" style=\"padding: 5rem 0;\">\n    <div class=\"gdas-container\">\n        <article class=\"gdas-deepdive-row dark-theme\" id=\"kineco\" style=\"border-bottom: none; padding: 0;\">\n            <div class=\"gdas-deepdive-grid\">\n                <div class=\"gdas-deepdive-image\">\n                    <img src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/themes/pixelpiernyc-child/assets/images/kineco.jpg\" alt=\"Kineco Aerospace Composite Workshop\" width=\"800\" height=\"500\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"gdas-deepdive-text\">\n                    <span class=\"sector-tag\" style=\"color: var(--gdas-gold);\">Advanced Composites ┬╖ Aerospace ┬╖ Defence</span>\n                    <h2>Kineco</h2>\n                    <div class=\"headline\">Building Advanced Materials for Demanding Industries</div>\n                    <p>\n                        Kineco designs and manufactures advanced composite products and assemblies for aerospace, defence, railways, and industrial applications.\n                    </p>\n                    <p>\n                        Composite manufacturing is a specialised business. Customers depend on precision, consistency, and the ability to meet demanding technical standards. Developing these capabilities takes years of expertise and sustained investment.\n                    </p>\n                    <p>\n                        Kineco has built advanced manufacturing infrastructure in India and established relationships across industries where supplier qualification matters enormously. What drew us to Kineco was the depth of capability it has built. Aerospace and defence manufacturing are expanding rapidly in India, and companies capable of delivering high-value components will play an important role in that growth.\n                    </p>\n                    <div style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.kinecogroup.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"gdas-btn gdas-btn-white gdas-btn-sm\">\n                            <span>Visit Kineco</span>\n                            <span class=\"gdas-btn-icon\">Γåù</span>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </article>\n    </div>\n</section><!-- CORE Energy Deep Dive (Warm Stone Background) -->\n<section style=\"background-color: var(--gdas-bg-warm); padding: 5rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gdas-border);\">\n    <div class=\"gdas-container\">\n        <article class=\"gdas-deepdive-row\" id=\"core-energy\" style=\"border-bottom: none; padding: 0;\">\n            <div class=\"gdas-deepdive-grid\">\n                <div class=\"gdas-deepdive-text\">\n                    <span class=\"sector-tag\">Nuclear Energy ┬╖ Heavy Engineering</span>\n                    <h2>CORE Energy</h2>\n                    <div class=\"headline\">Engineering for India\'s Nuclear Power Future</div>\n                    <p>\n                        CORE Energy Systems provides specialised engineering, manufacturing, and project-execution services across nuclear energy, defence, and critical power industries.\n                    </p>\n                    <p>\n                        Nuclear energy is one of the most technically demanding sectors in the world. The barriers to entry are high, qualification cycles are long, and there is zero room for error. Success requires engineering depth, regulatory understanding, and the ability to execute complex projects over extended periods.\n                    </p>\n                    <p>\n                        As electricity demand rises, India will need dependable sources of low-carbon baseload power while manufacturing more critical energy equipment domestically. CORE sits at the meeting point of these shifts. We backed an experienced company whose opportunity is tied to the long-term localisation of IndiaΓÇÖs energy infrastructure.\n                    </p>\n                    <div style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n                        <a href=\"https://core.co.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"gdas-btn gdas-btn-dark gdas-btn-sm\">\n                            <span>Visit CORE Energy</span>\n                            <span class=\"gdas-btn-icon\">Γåù</span>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"gdas-deepdive-image\">\n                    <img src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/themes/pixelpiernyc-child/assets/images/core-energy.jpg\" alt=\"CORE Energy Turbine Workshop\" width=\"800\" height=\"500\">\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </article>\n    </div>\n</section><!-- AirLife Gases Deep Dive (DEEP BLACK BACKGROUND) -->\n<section class=\"gdas-section-black\" style=\"padding: 5rem 0;\">\n    <div class=\"gdas-container\">\n        <article class=\"gdas-deepdive-row dark-theme\" id=\"airlife\" style=\"border-bottom: none; padding: 0;\">\n            <div class=\"gdas-deepdive-grid\">\n                <div class=\"gdas-deepdive-image\">\n                    <img src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/themes/pixelpiernyc-child/assets/images/airlife-gases.jpg\" alt=\"AirLife Specialty Gas Distribution\" width=\"800\" height=\"500\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"gdas-deepdive-text\">\n                    <span class=\"sector-tag\" style=\"color: var(--gdas-gold);\">Specialty Gases ┬╖ Industrial Infrastructure</span>\n                    <h2>AirLife Gases</h2>\n                    <div class=\"headline\">Securing the Gases That Critical Industries Depend On</div>\n                    <p>\n                        AirLife supplies helium and other high-purity specialty gases used across healthcare, semiconductor manufacturing, aerospace, pharmaceuticals, and scientific research.\n                    </p>\n                    <p>\n                        Specialty gases are rarely visible to the end customer, but essential industries cannot function without them. Helium is irreplaceable in medical MRI imaging, chip fabrication, and aerospace. The global supply chain, however, is concentrated and subject to price shocks.\n                    </p>\n                    <p>\n                        AirLife is building the sourcing, processing, and distribution capabilities needed to make this supply dependable. The founders bring substantial gas industry experience and a practical understanding of procurement, safety, and customer delivery. As India expands its electronics and healthcare capabilities, the need for reliable specialty gases will compound alongside them.\n                    </p>\n                    <div style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n                        <a href=\"https://airlifegases.com/india/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"gdas-btn gdas-btn-white gdas-btn-sm\">\n                            <span>Visit AirLife Gases</span>\n                            <span class=\"gdas-btn-icon\">Γåù</span>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </article>\n    </div>\n</section><!-- Agnikul Cosmos Deep Dive (Crisp White Background) -->\n<section style=\"background-color: #FFFFFF; padding: 5rem 0;\">\n    <div class=\"gdas-container\">\n        <article class=\"gdas-deepdive-row\" id=\"agnikul\" style=\"border-bottom: none; padding: 0;\">\n            <div class=\"gdas-deepdive-grid\">\n                <div class=\"gdas-deepdive-text\">\n                    <span class=\"sector-tag\">Space Technology ┬╖ Launch Vehicles</span>\n                    <h2>Agnikul Cosmos</h2>\n                    <div class=\"headline\">Expanding IndiaΓÇÖs Access to Space</div>\n                    <p>\n                        Agnikul is developing customizable orbital launch vehicles for small satellites, powered by proprietary 3D-printed rocket engines.\n                    </p>\n                    <p>\n                        Small-satellite operators often have to share larger rockets, accept fixed schedules, and compromise on orbital parameters. Agnikul\'s Agnibaan launch vehicle is designed to be configurable around individual payloads. At the centre of the platform is single-piece rocket engine technology produced using additive manufacturing.\n                    </p>\n                    <p>\n                        The team crossed an important milestone by successfully flight-testing its semi-cryogenic engine from IndiaΓÇÖs first privately developed launchpad. We invested because Agnikul combines original technology with an ambitious objective: making space access responsive and flexible, positioning India as a global provider of launch infrastructure.\n                    </p>\n                    <div style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n                        <a href=\"https://agnikul.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"gdas-btn gdas-btn-dark gdas-btn-sm\">\n                            <span>Visit Agnikul</span>\n                            <span class=\"gdas-btn-icon\">Γåù</span>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"gdas-deepdive-image\">\n                    <img src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/themes/pixelpiernyc-child/assets/images/agnikul.jpg\" alt=\"Agnikul Aerospace Engineers & Propulsion\" width=\"800\" height=\"500\">\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </article>\n    </div>\n</section><!-- 7. High-Impact Call to Action Banner (DEEP BLACK BACKGROUND) -->\n<section class=\"gdas-cta-banner\">\n    <div class=\"gdas-container\">\n        <div class=\"eyebrow-light\">Our Commitment</div>\n        <h2>India has no shortage of important problems to solve. We want to back the people choosing to solve them.</h2>\n        <p>If you\'re building in advanced manufacturing, deeptech, energy, or space, we\'d love to hear what you\'re working on.</p>\n        <div class=\"gdas-creed-badge\">\n            <span>For profit.</span>\n            <span>For good.</span>\n            <span>For India.</span>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n            <a href=\"/wordpress/contact/\" class=\"gdas-btn gdas-btn-gold\">\n                <span>Introduce Your Company</span>\n                <span class=\"gdas-btn-icon\">ΓåÆ</span>\n            </a>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>','Investments','','inherit','closed','closed','','987658-revision-v1','','','2026-09-03 06:41:25','2026-09-03 06:41:25','',987658,'https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/?p=987678',0,'revision','',0),(987679,1,'2026-09-03 06:41:25','2026-09-03 06:41:25','<!-- Hero Banner (Dark Background) -->\n<section class=\"gdas-page-hero-dark\">\n    <div class=\"gdas-container\">\n        <div class=\"gdas-hero-content-box\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0;\">\n            <div class=\"gdas-eyebrow\">Our Perspective</div>\n            <h1 class=\"gdas-hero-title-main\">The next decade will be built differently.</h1>\n            <p class=\"gdas-hero-subhead\">\n                For years, IndiaΓÇÖs startup story was mostly understood through consumer internet and software. That story is expanding rapidly into physical infrastructure, deep engineering, and sovereign capability.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section><!-- Perspective Narrative (Warm Stone) -->\n<section class=\"gdas-section-story\">\n    <div class=\"gdas-container\">\n        <div class=\"gdas-story-grid\">\n            <div>\n                <div class=\"gdas-eyebrow\">The Real Shift</div>\n                <h2 class=\"gdas-story-heading\">Beyond Software. Into Hard Capabilities.</h2>\n                <div class=\"gdas-story-body\">\n                    <p>\n                        Indian founders are now building orbital rockets, advanced defence assemblies, medical hardware, power turbines, and specialized gases.\n                    </p>\n                    <p>\n                        These companies take on problems that require serious capital, specialized technical understanding, and longer development timelines. Their progress isn\'t measured in downloads or app DAUs, but in certifications secured, plants commissioned, and mission-critical parts qualified.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"gdas-story-quote\">\n                        \"We believe these businesses will form an essential pillar of India\'s next chapter. They strengthen economic sovereignty and supply chain resilience.\"\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"gdas-story-media-card\">\n                <img src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/themes/pixelpiernyc-child/assets/images/hero-builders.jpg\" alt=\"Modern Advanced Manufacturing Complex\" width=\"800\" height=\"550\">\n                <div class=\"gdas-story-media-badge\">\n                    Industrial Infrastructure & Manufacturing\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section><!-- Conviction Framework (DEEP BLACK BACKGROUND) -->\n<section class=\"gdas-section-framework gdas-section-black\" style=\"padding: 6rem 0;\">\n    <div class=\"gdas-container\">\n        <div class=\"gdas-section-header\">\n            <div class=\"gdas-eyebrow\">How We Underwrite</div>\n            <h2>What Earns Our Conviction</h2>\n            <p class=\"gdas-lede\">The sector may change. The stage may change. What matters is the presence of a meaningful problem, a differentiated business, and the ability to create lasting value.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"gdas-framework-grid\">\n            <div class=\"gdas-framework-card dark-theme\">\n                <div class=\"gdas-framework-icon-wrap\">\n                    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M12 2a5 5 0 100 10 5 5 0 000-10zM4 21v-2a6 6 0 0112 0v2\"/></svg>\n                </div>\n                <h3>Founders who know the problem inside out</h3>\n                <p>We value founders who understand their industry from the inside. They know the customer, the constraints, and why earlier attempts fell short.</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"gdas-framework-card dark-theme\">\n                <div class=\"gdas-framework-icon-wrap\">\n                    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"11\" width=\"18\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0110 0v4\"/></svg>\n                </div>\n                <h3>Something difficult to build</h3>\n                <p>We are attracted to businesses whose capabilities cannot be recreated quickly with money aloneΓÇöwhether protected by patents, specialized tooling, or regulatory licenses.</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"gdas-framework-card dark-theme\">\n                <div class=\"gdas-framework-icon-wrap\">\n                    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 11-5.93-9.14\"/><path d=\"M22 4L12 14.01l-3-3\"/></svg>\n                </div>\n                <h3>A real customer need</h3>\n                <p>The product should solve an unavoidable problem. We want to understand who needs it, how it is addressed today, and why your solution is orders of magnitude better.</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"gdas-framework-card dark-theme\">\n                <div class=\"gdas-framework-icon-wrap\">\n                    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><polyline points=\"22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12\"/></svg>\n                </div>\n                <h3>Evidence that the market cares</h3>\n                <p>At an early stage, this evidence can take different forms: pilot commitments, repeat orders, technical validation, or strong commercial pull.</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"gdas-framework-card dark-theme\">\n                <div class=\"gdas-framework-icon-wrap\">\n                    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M16 8l-8 8M8 8l8 8\"/></svg>\n                </div>\n                <h3>A large future</h3>\n                <p>We look for businesses that can become meaningfully larger over time, propelled by long-term shifts in geopolitics, domestic localization, and industrial expansion.</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"gdas-framework-card dark-theme\">\n                <div class=\"gdas-framework-icon-wrap\">\n                    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"/></svg>\n                </div>\n                <h3>Thoughtful use of capital</h3>\n                <p>Capital should help the company cross a decisive threshold. We value founders who know exactly what milestones the round unlocks.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section><!-- Our Approach (Crisp White) -->\n<section class=\"gdas-section-story\" style=\"background-color: #FFFFFF;\">\n    <div class=\"gdas-container\">\n        <div class=\"gdas-story-grid\">\n            <div class=\"gdas-story-media-card\">\n                <img src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/themes/pixelpiernyc-child/assets/images/agnikul.jpg\" alt=\"Agnikul Space Technology Team\" width=\"800\" height=\"550\">\n                <div class=\"gdas-story-media-badge\">\n                    Private Launch Vehicle Engineers\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div>\n                <div class=\"gdas-eyebrow\">Our Approach</div>\n                <h2 class=\"gdas-story-heading\">Independent Capital. Patient Conviction.</h2>\n                <div class=\"gdas-story-body\">\n                    <p>\n                        We invest our own capital and make each decision independently. That gives us the freedom to remain selective, think over longer horizons, and back companies that may take time to be fully recognized by traditional markets.\n                    </p>\n                    <p>\n                        Early-stage investing in hard technologies is fundamentally an act of judgment under uncertainty. We don\'t expect zero riskΓÇöwhat we look for is a compelling reason to believe: in the founders, their technical defensibility, and the future they are building.\n                    </p>\n                    <p>\n                        Our investments in <strong>Kineco</strong>, <strong>CORE Energy</strong>, <strong>AirLife Gases</strong>, and <strong>Agnikul</strong> are four expressions of that conviction.\n                    </p>\n                    <div style=\"margin-top: 2rem;\">\n                        <a href=\"/wordpress/contact/\" class=\"gdas-btn gdas-btn-dark\">\n                            <span>Partner With Us</span>\n                            <span class=\"gdas-btn-icon\">ΓåÆ</span>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section><!-- 7. High-Impact Call to Action Banner (DEEP BLACK BACKGROUND) -->\n<section class=\"gdas-cta-banner\">\n    <div class=\"gdas-container\">\n        <div class=\"eyebrow-light\">Our Commitment</div>\n        <h2>India has no shortage of important problems to solve. We want to back the people choosing to solve them.</h2>\n        <p>If you\'re building in advanced manufacturing, deeptech, energy, or space, we\'d love to hear what you\'re working on.</p>\n        <div class=\"gdas-creed-badge\">\n            <span>For profit.</span>\n            <span>For good.</span>\n            <span>For India.</span>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n            <a href=\"/wordpress/contact/\" class=\"gdas-btn gdas-btn-gold\">\n                <span>Introduce Your Company</span>\n                <span class=\"gdas-btn-icon\">ΓåÆ</span>\n            </a>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>','Our Perspective','','inherit','closed','closed','','987659-revision-v1','','','2026-09-03 06:41:25','2026-09-03 06:41:25','',987659,'https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/?p=987679',0,'revision','',0),(987680,1,'2026-09-03 06:41:26','2026-09-03 06:41:26','<!-- Hero Banner (Dark Background) -->\n<section class=\"gdas-page-hero-dark\">\n    <div class=\"gdas-container\">\n        <div class=\"gdas-hero-content-box\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0;\">\n            <div class=\"gdas-eyebrow\">About GDas Ventures</div>\n            <h1 class=\"gdas-hero-title-main\">A private investment platform built for builders.</h1>\n            <p class=\"gdas-hero-subhead\">\n                Backing ambitious companies connected to IndiaΓÇÖs long-term industrial and technological growth.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section><!-- About Story (Warm Stone) -->\n<section class=\"gdas-section-story\">\n    <div class=\"gdas-container\">\n        <div class=\"gdas-story-grid\">\n            <div>\n                <div class=\"gdas-eyebrow\">Who We Are</div>\n                <h2 class=\"gdas-story-heading\">Patient Capital for Consequential Businesses</h2>\n                <div class=\"gdas-story-body\">\n                    <p>\n                        GDas Ventures is a private investment platform backing ambitious companies connected to IndiaΓÇÖs long-term growth.\n                    </p>\n                    <p>\n                        We invest across stages and sectors, with a particular focus on companies developing important technologies, industrial capabilities, and infrastructure. Our current investments span advanced composites, nuclear engineering, specialty gases, and space launch systems.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"gdas-story-quote\">\n                        \"We are at the beginning of our journey. Our intention is to build a thoughtful portfolio over time, learn from every investment, and develop lasting relationships with the founders we back.\"\n                    </div>\n                    <p style=\"font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--gdas-navy);\">\n                        For profit. For good. For India.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"gdas-story-media-card\">\n                <img src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/themes/pixelpiernyc-child/assets/images/kineco.jpg\" alt=\"Kineco Aerospace Assembly\" width=\"800\" height=\"550\">\n                <div class=\"gdas-story-media-badge\">\n                    High-Tech Manufacturing Floor\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section><!-- 7. High-Impact Call to Action Banner (DEEP BLACK BACKGROUND) -->\n<section class=\"gdas-cta-banner\">\n    <div class=\"gdas-container\">\n        <div class=\"eyebrow-light\">Our Commitment</div>\n        <h2>India has no shortage of important problems to solve. We want to back the people choosing to solve them.</h2>\n        <p>If you\'re building in advanced manufacturing, deeptech, energy, or space, we\'d love to hear what you\'re working on.</p>\n        <div class=\"gdas-creed-badge\">\n            <span>For profit.</span>\n            <span>For good.</span>\n            <span>For India.</span>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n            <a href=\"/wordpress/contact/\" class=\"gdas-btn gdas-btn-gold\">\n                <span>Introduce Your Company</span>\n                <span class=\"gdas-btn-icon\">ΓåÆ</span>\n            </a>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>','About','Telling your brand story through design ','inherit','closed','closed','','1467-revision-v1','','','2026-09-03 06:41:26','2026-09-03 06:41:26','',1467,'https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/?p=987680',0,'revision','',0),(987681,1,'2026-09-03 06:41:26','2026-09-03 06:41:26','<!-- Hero Banner (Dark Background) -->\n<section class=\"gdas-page-hero-dark\">\n    <div class=\"gdas-container\">\n        <div class=\"gdas-hero-content-box\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0;\">\n            <div class=\"gdas-eyebrow\">Get In Touch</div>\n            <h1 class=\"gdas-hero-title-main\">Building something that matters?</h1>\n            <p class=\"gdas-hero-subhead\">\n                We are always interested in meeting founders working on difficult, meaningful problems. Tell us what you are building, why it needs to exist, and why your team is the one to build it.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section><!-- Contact Info & Pitch Form -->\n<section class=\"gdas-contact-wrapper\">\n    <div class=\"gdas-container\">\n        <div class=\"gdas-story-grid\" style=\"align-items: start;\">\n            <div>\n                <div class=\"gdas-eyebrow\">Direct Conversation</div>\n                <h2 style=\"font-size: 2.4rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;\">Let\'s Talk Directly</h2>\n                <p style=\"font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--gdas-text-secondary); margin-bottom: 2rem;\">\n                    We don\'t make founders jump through hoops or pitch to junior analysts. If there is mutual alignment on conviction, problem depth, and defensibility, you speak directly with decision-makers.\n                </p>\n\n                <div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid var(--gdas-border); border-radius: var(--gdas-radius-md); padding: 2rem; box-shadow: var(--gdas-shadow-subtle);\">\n                    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\">\n                        <span style=\"font-size: 0.78rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: var(--gdas-gold); font-weight: 700; display: block; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;\">Direct Email</span>\n                        <a href=\"mailto:contact@gdasventures.com\" style=\"font-size: 1.2rem; color: var(--gdas-navy); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700;\">contact@gdasventures.com</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\">\n                        <span style=\"font-size: 0.78rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: var(--gdas-gold); font-weight: 700; display: block; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;\">Platform Model</span>\n                        <span style=\"font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--gdas-text-secondary); font-weight: 500;\">Private Investment Platform ┬╖ India</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <span style=\"font-size: 0.78rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: var(--gdas-gold); font-weight: 700; display: block; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;\">Network</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://linkedin.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--gdas-navy); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;\">LinkedIn Profile Γåù</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Founder Submission Form -->\n            <div class=\"gdas-contact-box\">\n                <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.75rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--gdas-navy);\">Introduce Your Company</h3>\n                <p style=\"font-size: 0.98rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; color: var(--gdas-text-muted);\">\n                    Fill in brief details below. We review every thoughtful submission.\n                </p>\n\n                <div id=\"gdas-form-msg\" class=\"gdas-form-msg\"></div>\n\n                <form id=\"gdas-pitch-form\" method=\"POST\">\n                    <div class=\"gdas-contact-grid\">\n                        <div class=\"gdas-form-field\">\n                            <label for=\"p-name\">Founder Name *</label>\n                            <input type=\"text\" id=\"p-name\" name=\"name\" class=\"gdas-input\" required placeholder=\"Your full name\">\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"gdas-form-field\">\n                            <label for=\"p-email\">Work Email *</label>\n                            <input type=\"email\" id=\"p-email\" name=\"email\" class=\"gdas-input\" required placeholder=\"founder@company.com\">\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"gdas-form-field\">\n                            <label for=\"p-company\">Company Name *</label>\n                            <input type=\"text\" id=\"p-company\" name=\"company\" class=\"gdas-input\" required placeholder=\"e.g. Acme Technologies\">\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"gdas-form-field\">\n                            <label for=\"p-website\">Company Website</label>\n                            <input type=\"url\" id=\"p-website\" name=\"website\" class=\"gdas-input\" placeholder=\"https://company.com\">\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"gdas-form-field\">\n                            <label for=\"p-sector\">Primary Domain</label>\n                            <select id=\"p-sector\" name=\"sector\" class=\"gdas-select\">\n                                <option value=\"Defence & Aerospace\">Defence & Aerospace</option>\n                                <option value=\"Advanced Manufacturing\">Advanced Manufacturing</option>\n                                <option value=\"Energy & Nuclear\">Energy & Nuclear</option>\n                                <option value=\"Specialty Gases & Infrastructure\">Specialty Gases & Infrastructure</option>\n                                <option value=\"Space Technology\">Space Technology</option>\n                                <option value=\"Semiconductors & Hardware\">Semiconductors & Hardware</option>\n                                <option value=\"Healthcare & Deeptech\">Healthcare & Deeptech</option>\n                                <option value=\"Bharat-Focused\">Bharat-Focused</option>\n                                <option value=\"Other\">Other Critical Domain</option>\n                            </select>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"gdas-form-field\">\n                            <label for=\"p-stage\">Current Stage</label>\n                            <select id=\"p-stage\" name=\"stage\" class=\"gdas-select\">\n                                <option value=\"R&D / Pre-Seed\">R&D / Pre-Seed</option>\n                                <option value=\"Seed\">Seed</option>\n                                <option value=\"Series A\">Series A</option>\n                                <option value=\"Growth / Later\">Growth / Later</option>\n                            </select>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"gdas-form-field col-full\">\n                            <label for=\"p-details\">What are you building? *</label>\n                            <textarea id=\"p-details\" name=\"pitch\" class=\"gdas-textarea\" required placeholder=\"Briefly describe what problem you are solving, your technological moat, and key milestones achieved.\"></textarea>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"gdas-form-field col-full\">\n                            <label for=\"p-deck\">Pitch Deck / Memo Link (Google Drive, DocSend)</label>\n                            <input type=\"url\" id=\"p-deck\" name=\"deck\" class=\"gdas-input\" placeholder=\"https://docsend.com/view/example\">\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"col-full\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem;\">\n                            <button type=\"submit\" class=\"gdas-btn gdas-btn-dark\" style=\"width: 100%; padding: 1rem;\">\n                                <span>Submit Introduction</span>\n                                <span class=\"gdas-btn-icon\">ΓåÆ</span>\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </form>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>','Contact','Let\'s build something great','inherit','closed','closed','','1053-revision-v1','','','2026-09-03 06:41:26','2026-09-03 06:41:26','',1053,'https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/?p=987681',0,'revision','',0),(987682,0,'2026-09-03 06:42:19','2026-09-03 06:42:19','Founder: Rohan Sharma\nEmail: rohan@deeptechindia.example\nCompany: AeroDynamics India\nWebsite: https://aerodynamics.example\nSector: Aerospace &amp; Defence\nStage: Seed\nDeck Link: https://docsend.com/view/example123\n\n--- Pitch Details ---\nDeveloping indigenous composite turbomachinery components for unmanned aerospace systems.','AeroDynamics India ΓÇö Rohan Sharma','','publish','closed','closed','','aerodynamics-india-rohan-sharma-7','','','2026-09-03 06:42:19','2026-09-03 06:42:19','',0,'https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/gdas_pitch/aerodynamics-india-rohan-sharma-7/',0,'gdas_pitch','',0),(987683,0,'2026-09-03 06:50:23','2026-09-03 06:50:23','','Modern Indian Manufacturing Complex','','inherit','','closed','','modern-indian-manufacturing-complex','','','2026-09-03 06:50:23','2026-09-03 06:50:23','',0,'https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/gdas/hero-builders.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(987684,0,'2026-09-03 06:50:23','2026-09-03 06:50:23','','Kineco Aerospace Composite Manufacturing','','inherit','','closed','','kineco-aerospace-composite-manufacturing','','','2026-09-03 06:50:23','2026-09-03 06:50:23','',0,'https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/gdas/kineco.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(987685,0,'2026-09-03 06:50:23','2026-09-03 06:50:23','','CORE Energy Heavy Turbine &amp; Nuclear Engineering','','inherit','','closed','','core-energy-heavy-turbine-nuclear-engineering','','','2026-09-03 06:50:23','2026-09-03 06:50:23','',0,'https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/gdas/core-energy.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(987686,0,'2026-09-03 06:50:23','2026-09-03 06:50:23','','AirLife Specialty Gas Distribution Warehouse','','inherit','','closed','','airlife-specialty-gas-distribution-warehouse','','','2026-09-03 06:50:23','2026-09-03 06:50:23','',0,'https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/gdas/airlife-gases.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(987687,0,'2026-09-03 06:50:23','2026-09-03 06:50:23','','Agnikul Cosmos Aerospace Engineers &amp; Rocket Engine','','inherit','','closed','','agnikul-cosmos-aerospace-engineers-rocket-engine','','','2026-09-03 06:50:23','2026-09-03 06:50:23','',0,'https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/gdas/agnikul.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(987688,0,'2026-09-03 06:50:23','2026-09-03 06:50:23','','Materials Science Testing Laboratory','','inherit','','closed','','materials-science-testing-laboratory','','','2026-09-03 06:50:23','2026-09-03 06:50:23','',0,'https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/gdas/india-building.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(987689,0,'2026-09-03 06:50:23','2026-09-03 06:50:23','','G Das Ventures Logo (Transparent Dark)','','inherit','','closed','','g-das-ventures-logo-transparent-dark','','','2026-09-03 06:50:23','2026-09-03 06:50:23','',0,'https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/gdas/logo.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(987690,0,'2026-09-03 06:50:23','2026-09-03 06:50:23','','G Das Ventures Logo (Transparent Light)','','inherit','','closed','','g-das-ventures-logo-transparent-light','','','2026-09-03 06:50:23','2026-09-03 06:50:23','',0,'https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/gdas/logo-light.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(987691,1,'2026-09-03 06:52:36','0000-00-00 00:00:00','','Auto Draft','','auto-draft','','open','','','','','2026-09-03 06:52:36','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/?p=987691',0,'post','',0),(987692,0,'2026-09-03 06:54:27','2026-09-03 06:54:27','Founder: Rohan Sharma\nEmail: rohan@deeptechindia.example\nCompany: AeroDynamics India\nWebsite: https://aerodynamics.example\nSector: Aerospace &amp; Defence\nStage: Seed\nDeck Link: https://docsend.com/view/example123\n\n--- Pitch Details ---\nDeveloping indigenous composite turbomachinery components for unmanned aerospace systems.','AeroDynamics India ΓÇö Rohan Sharma','','publish','closed','closed','','aerodynamics-india-rohan-sharma-8','','','2026-09-03 06:54:27','2026-09-03 06:54:27','',0,'https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/gdas_pitch/aerodynamics-india-rohan-sharma-8/',0,'gdas_pitch','',0),(987693,1,'2026-09-03 06:58:02','2026-09-03 06:58:02','<h6>ABOUT GDAS VENTURES</h6>					<h1>A private investment platform built for builders.</h1>		<p>Backing ambitious companies connected to IndiaΓÇÖs long-term industrial and technological growth.</p>			<h6>WHO WE ARE</h6>					<h2>Patient Capital for Consequential Businesses</h2>		<p>GDas Ventures is a private investment platform backing ambitious companies connected to IndiaΓÇÖs long-term growth.</p><p>We invest across stages and sectors, with a particular focus on companies developing important technologies, industrial capabilities, and infrastructure. Our current investments span advanced composites, nuclear engineering, specialty gases, and space launch systems.</p><blockquote style=\"border-left: 4px solid #B88E44; padding-left: 1.5rem; margin: 1.5rem 0; font-weight: 600; color: #0e1113;\"><p>ΓÇ£We are at the beginning of our journey. Our intention is to build a thoughtful portfolio over time, learn from every investment, and develop lasting relationships with the founders we back.ΓÇ¥</p></blockquote><p style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #0e1113;\">For profit. For good. For India.</p>													<img width=\"1376\" height=\"768\" src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/gdas/kineco.jpg\" alt=\"\" />','About','Telling your brand story through design ','inherit','closed','closed','','1467-autosave-v1','','','2026-09-03 06:58:03','2026-09-03 06:58:03','',1467,'https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/?p=987693',0,'revision','',0),(987694,1,'2026-09-03 06:58:19','0000-00-00 00:00:00','','Auto Draft','','auto-draft','','open','','','','','2026-09-03 06:58:19','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/?p=987694',0,'post','',0),(987695,1,'2026-09-03 06:58:43','2026-09-03 06:58:43','<h6>PRIVATE INVESTMENT PLATFORM</h6>					<h1>Backing the founders building India\'s industrial backbone.</h1>		<p>We invest our own patient capital into ambitious Indian companies solving technically hard problems across aerospace, heavy engineering, nuclear energy, and space technology.</p>								<a href=\"/wordpress/investments/\">\n									Explore Our Investments Γåù\n					</a>\n														<a href=\"/wordpress/contact/\">\n									Introduce Your Company ΓåÆ\n					</a>\n																			<img width=\"1376\" height=\"768\" src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/gdas/hero-builders.jpg\" alt=\"\" />																<h4>Private Balance Sheet</h4>		<p>We deploy our own capital. No LP fund clocks, no artificial exit pressures.</p>			<h4>Four Anchor Platforms</h4>		<p>High-conviction investments in Kineco, CORE Energy, AirLife Gases, and Agnikul.</p>			<h4>10+ Year Horizon</h4>		<p>Patient partnership for businesses with complex engineering and long qualification cycles.</p>			<h6>OUR THESIS</h6>					<h2>IndiaΓÇÖs next generation of companies will not be built only in software.</h2>		<p>For years, Indian venture capital was largely understood through consumer internet, fintech, and software services. That era laid vital digital foundations, but India is ready for something substantially broader.</p><p>The defining businesses of the next thirty years will be forged in workshops, precision machining bays, engineering centres, and launch facilities.</p><blockquote style=\"border-left: 4px solid #B88E44; padding-left: 1.5rem; margin: 1.5rem 0; font-weight: 600; color: #0e1113;\"><p>ΓÇ£These businesses take years to build. They solve technically hard problems and require founders willing to build before the market makes it obvious.ΓÇ¥</p></blockquote>													<img width=\"1376\" height=\"768\" src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/gdas/india-building.jpg\" alt=\"\" />																<h6>PORTFOLIO</h6>					<h2>Companies We Have Backed</h2>		<p style=\"text-align: center; max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto 3rem;\">Every investment begins with conviction in a company, its founders, and what they are setting out to build.</p>													<img width=\"1376\" height=\"768\" src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/gdas/kineco.jpg\" alt=\"\" />																<h6>AEROSPACE &amp; DEFENCE</h6>					<h3>Kineco</h3>					<h5>Advanced Composites for Aerospace, Defence &amp; Rail</h5>		<p>Kineco designs and manufactures critical composite assemblies that must withstand extreme environments. Developing these capabilities requires years of domain expertise, stringent quality certifications, and capital discipline.</p>								<a href=\"/wordpress/investments/#kineco\">\n									Why We Invested ΓåÆ\n					</a>\n														<a href=\"https://kinecogroup.com\">\n									kinecogroup.com\n					</a>\n																			<img width=\"1376\" height=\"768\" src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/gdas/core-energy.jpg\" alt=\"\" />																<h6>NUCLEAR ENERGY ┬╖ HEAVY ENGINEERING</h6>					<h3>CORE Energy</h3>					<h5>Engineering for India\'s Nuclear Power Future</h5>		<p>Providing specialised engineering and equipment manufacturing across nuclear energy and defence. In a sector with high barriers to entry and long qualification cycles, CORE sits at the intersection of rising baseload power demand and domestic manufacturing.</p>								<a href=\"/wordpress/investments/#core-energy\">\n									Why We Invested ΓåÆ\n					</a>\n														<a href=\"https://core.co.in\">\n									core.co.in\n					</a>\n																			<img width=\"1376\" height=\"768\" src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/gdas/airlife-gases.jpg\" alt=\"\" />																<h6>SPECIALTY GASES ┬╖ INFRASTRUCTURE</h6>					<h3>AirLife Gases</h3>					<h5>Critical High-Purity Gas Supply Chains</h5>		<p>Supplying helium and ultra-high-purity specialty gases required by semiconductor fabrication, medical MRI imaging, and aerospace. AirLife is building the domestic distribution footprint to protect vital industries from supply interruptions.</p>								<a href=\"/wordpress/investments/#airlife\">\n									Why We Invested ΓåÆ\n					</a>\n														<a href=\"https://airlifegases.com\">\n									airlifegases.com\n					</a>\n																			<img width=\"1376\" height=\"768\" src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/gdas/agnikul.jpg\" alt=\"\" />																<h6>SPACE TECHNOLOGY ┬╖ LAUNCH VEHICLES</h6>					<h3>Agnikul Cosmos</h3>					<h5>Flexible Orbital Launch Powered by 3D Printing</h5>		<p>Developing customizable small-satellite launch vehicles powered by patented, single-piece 3D-printed rocket engines. Agnikul successfully flight-tested its semi-cryogenic engine from IndiaΓÇÖs first privately developed launchpad.</p>								<a href=\"/wordpress/investments/#agnikul\">\n									Why We Invested ΓåÆ\n					</a>\n														<a href=\"https://agnikul.in\">\n									agnikul.in\n					</a>\n									<h6>OUR UNDERWRITING</h6>					<h2>What Earns Our Conviction</h2>		<p style=\"text-align: center; max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto 3rem;\">We care less about buzzwords or market trends, and more about whether you are solving an authentic, hard problem that creates lasting value.</p>					\n									<h4>\n							Founders who know the problem inside out						\n					</h4>\n									<p>\n						We look for teams who have lived the friction firsthand. They understand customer constraints and know exactly why earlier solutions failed.					</p>\n									<h4>\n							Something genuinely difficult to replicate						\n					</h4>\n									<p>\n						We favor companies whose core capability cannot be duplicated with capital aloneΓÇöwhether protected by proprietary tech, manufacturing depth, or certifications.					</p>\n									<h4>\n							A real, urgent customer requirement						\n					</h4>\n									<p>\n						The product must solve a critical pain point. We want to see why customers cannot operate without your solution today.					</p>\n									<h4>\n							Tangible evidence that the market cares						\n					</h4>\n									<p>\n						Validation can take many shapes: pilot programs, repeat purchase orders, technical qualification benchmarks, or customer prepayment.					</p>\n									<h4>\n							Room to become meaningfully larger						\n					</h4>\n									<p>\n						We invest in companies riding multi-decade macro tailwindsΓÇödomestic supply security, industrialization, and global supply chain rebalancing.					</p>\n									<h4>\n							Thoughtful use of capital						\n					</h4>\n									<p>\n						Capital should unlock concrete milestones. We back founders who know what they need to prove next and treat every rupee with respect.					</p>\n							<h6>INVESTMENT FOCUS</h6>					<h2>Sector Agnostic. Thesis Driven.</h2>		<p style=\"text-align: center; max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto 3rem;\">We back companies across eight critical areas shaping India\'s economic sovereignty.</p>			<h6>01</h6>					<h4>Defence &amp; Aerospace</h4>		<p>Composites, avionics, unmanned aerial systems, and sovereign defence hardware.</p>			<h6>02</h6>					<h4>Advanced Manufacturing</h4>		<p>Precision tooling, robotic fabrication, heavy metallurgy, and complex assembly.</p>			<h6>03</h6>					<h4>Energy &amp; Nuclear</h4>		<p>Low-carbon baseload power, specialized reactor valves, and grid infrastructure.</p>			<h6>04</h6>					<h4>Specialty Gases</h4>		<p>Helium, argon, and high-purity gases critical for semiconductors, MRI, and space.</p>			<h6>05</h6>					<h4>Deeptech &amp; Space</h4>		<p>Propulsion systems, small-satellite launch systems, optics, and additive manufacturing.</p>			<h6>06</h6>					<h4>Semiconductors</h4>		<p>Testing, packaging, fab equipment components, and domestic electronic assemblies.</p>			<h6>07</h6>					<h4>Healthcare Tech</h4>		<p>Biomedical engineering, diagnostic hardware, medical imaging, and active ingredients.</p>			<h6>08</h6>					<h4>Bharat-Focused</h4>		<p>Logistics, rural supply infrastructure, clean mobility, and productive industrial assets.</p>			<h6>HOW WE WORK</h6>					<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>		<p style=\"text-align: center; max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto 3rem;\">Direct answers for founders considering partnering with G Das Ventures.</p>					\n												<a tabindex=\"0\">How does a private investment platform differ from a standard VC fund?</a>\n					Institutional VC funds raise third-party money with a strict 7 to 10-year lifespan, forcing them to push for exits regardless of market conditions. We invest our own balance sheet. We answer to no external LP committees, meaning we can hold investments for 10, 15, or 20 years if it allows the business to reach its full potential.\n												<a tabindex=\"0\">What stage of companies do you back?</a>\n					We are stage-flexible. What matters is not whether you are pre-revenue or scaling, but whether you have genuine technical depth, defensibility, and a clear path toward building valuable physical or industrial infrastructure.\n												<a tabindex=\"0\">How do you support companies beyond capital?</a>\n					We actively help portfolio companies with industrial supplier qualification, customer introductions in demanding sectors like aerospace and energy, regulatory guidance, and navigating government procurement channels.\n												<a tabindex=\"0\">What does the pitch process look like?</a>\n					Our feedback loop is fast and direct. When you submit through our contact form or reach out, you talk directly with the decision-makers. There are no junior analyst filters. If there is mutual alignment, we schedule a technical deep-dive.\n							<h6>OUR COMMITMENT</h6>					<h2>India has no shortage of important problems to solve. We want to back the people choosing to solve them.</h2>		<p style=\"text-align: center; max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto 2rem;\">If you\'re building in advanced manufacturing, deeptech, energy, or space, we\'d love to hear what you\'re working on.</p>			<h4>For profit.  ┬╖  For good.  ┬╖  For India.</h4>										<a href=\"/wordpress/contact/\">\n									Introduce Your Company ΓåÆ\n					</a>','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','987657-autosave-v1','','','2026-09-03 06:58:45','2026-09-03 06:58:45','',987657,'https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/?p=987695',0,'revision','',0),(987696,0,'2026-09-03 07:02:44','2026-09-03 07:02:44','Founder: Rohan Sharma\nEmail: rohan@deeptechindia.example\nCompany: AeroDynamics India\nWebsite: https://aerodynamics.example\nSector: Aerospace &amp; Defence\nStage: Seed\nDeck Link: https://docsend.com/view/example123\n\n--- Pitch Details ---\nDeveloping indigenous composite turbomachinery components for unmanned aerospace systems.','AeroDynamics India ΓÇö Rohan Sharma','','publish','closed','closed','','aerodynamics-india-rohan-sharma-9','','','2026-09-03 07:02:44','2026-09-03 07:02:44','',0,'https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/gdas_pitch/aerodynamics-india-rohan-sharma-9/',0,'gdas_pitch','',0),(987697,0,'2026-09-03 07:11:08','2026-09-03 07:11:08','Founder: Rohan Sharma\nEmail: rohan@deeptechindia.example\nCompany: AeroDynamics India\nWebsite: https://aerodynamics.example\nSector: Aerospace &amp; Defence\nStage: Seed\nDeck Link: https://docsend.com/view/example123\n\n--- Pitch Details ---\nDeveloping indigenous composite turbomachinery components for unmanned aerospace systems.','AeroDynamics India ΓÇö Rohan Sharma','','publish','closed','closed','','aerodynamics-india-rohan-sharma-10','','','2026-09-03 07:11:08','2026-09-03 07:11:08','',0,'https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/gdas_pitch/aerodynamics-india-rohan-sharma-10/',0,'gdas_pitch','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (987698,1,'2026-09-03 12:12:56','2026-09-03 12:12:56','<!-- Hero Banner (Dark Background) -->\n<section class=\"gdas-page-hero-dark\">\n    <div class=\"gdas-container\">\n        <div class=\"gdas-hero-content-box\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0;\">\n            <div class=\"gdas-eyebrow\">Portfolio</div>\n            <h1 class=\"gdas-hero-title-main\">Companies We Have Backed</h1>\n            <p class=\"gdas-hero-subhead\">\n                Every investment begins with conviction in a company, its founders, and what they are setting out to build. Here is why we backed each of them.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section><!-- Kineco Deep Dive (DEEP BLACK BACKGROUND) -->\n<section class=\"gdas-section-black\" style=\"padding: 5rem 0;\">\n    <div class=\"gdas-container\">\n        <article class=\"gdas-deepdive-row dark-theme\" id=\"kineco\" style=\"border-bottom: none; padding: 0;\">\n            <div class=\"gdas-deepdive-grid\">\n                <div class=\"gdas-deepdive-image\">\n                    <img src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/themes/pixelpiernyc-child/assets/images/kineco.jpg\" alt=\"Kineco Aerospace Composite Workshop\" width=\"800\" height=\"500\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"gdas-deepdive-text\">\n                    <span class=\"sector-tag\" style=\"color: var(--gdas-gold);\">Advanced Composites ┬╖ Aerospace ┬╖ Defence</span>\n                    <h2>Kineco</h2>\n                    <div class=\"headline\">Building Advanced Materials for Demanding Industries</div>\n                    <p>\n                        Kineco designs and manufactures advanced composite products and assemblies for aerospace, defence, railways, and industrial applications.\n                    </p>\n                    <p>\n                        Composite manufacturing is a specialised business. Customers depend on precision, consistency, and the ability to meet demanding technical standards. Developing these capabilities takes years of expertise and sustained investment.\n                    </p>\n                    <p>\n                        Kineco has built advanced manufacturing infrastructure in India and established relationships across industries where supplier qualification matters enormously. What drew us to Kineco was the depth of capability it has built. Aerospace and defence manufacturing are expanding rapidly in India, and companies capable of delivering high-value components will play an important role in that growth.\n                    </p>\n                    <div style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.kinecogroup.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"gdas-btn gdas-btn-white gdas-btn-sm\">\n                            <span>Visit Kineco</span>\n                            <span class=\"gdas-btn-icon\">Γåù</span>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </article>\n    </div>\n</section><!-- CORE Energy Deep Dive (Warm Stone Background) -->\n<section style=\"background-color: var(--gdas-bg-warm); padding: 5rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gdas-border);\">\n    <div class=\"gdas-container\">\n        <article class=\"gdas-deepdive-row\" id=\"core-energy\" style=\"border-bottom: none; padding: 0;\">\n            <div class=\"gdas-deepdive-grid\">\n                <div class=\"gdas-deepdive-text\">\n                    <span class=\"sector-tag\">Nuclear Energy ┬╖ Heavy Engineering</span>\n                    <h2>CORE Energy</h2>\n                    <div class=\"headline\">Engineering for India\'s Nuclear Power Future</div>\n                    <p>\n                        CORE Energy Systems provides specialised engineering, manufacturing, and project-execution services across nuclear energy, defence, and critical power industries.\n                    </p>\n                    <p>\n                        Nuclear energy is one of the most technically demanding sectors in the world. The barriers to entry are high, qualification cycles are long, and there is zero room for error. Success requires engineering depth, regulatory understanding, and the ability to execute complex projects over extended periods.\n                    </p>\n                    <p>\n                        As electricity demand rises, India will need dependable sources of low-carbon baseload power while manufacturing more critical energy equipment domestically. CORE sits at the meeting point of these shifts. We backed an experienced company whose opportunity is tied to the long-term localisation of IndiaΓÇÖs energy infrastructure.\n                    </p>\n                    <div style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n                        <a href=\"https://core.co.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"gdas-btn gdas-btn-dark gdas-btn-sm\">\n                            <span>Visit CORE Energy</span>\n                            <span class=\"gdas-btn-icon\">Γåù</span>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"gdas-deepdive-image\">\n                    <img src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/themes/pixelpiernyc-child/assets/images/core-energy.jpg\" alt=\"CORE Energy Turbine Workshop\" width=\"800\" height=\"500\">\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </article>\n    </div>\n</section><!-- AirLife Gases Deep Dive (DEEP BLACK BACKGROUND) -->\n<section class=\"gdas-section-black\" style=\"padding: 5rem 0;\">\n    <div class=\"gdas-container\">\n        <article class=\"gdas-deepdive-row dark-theme\" id=\"airlife\" style=\"border-bottom: none; padding: 0;\">\n            <div class=\"gdas-deepdive-grid\">\n                <div class=\"gdas-deepdive-image\">\n                    <img src=\"https://grey-tapir-780392.hostingersite.com/wp-content/themes/pixelpiernyc-child/assets/images/airlife-gases.jpg\" alt=\"AirLife Specialty Gas Distribution\" width=\"800\" height=\"500\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"gdas-deepdive-text\">\n                    <span class=\"sector-tag\" style=\"color: var(--gdas-gold);\">Specialty Gases ┬╖ Industrial Infrastructure</span>\n                    <h2>AirLife Gases</h2>\n                    <div class=\"headline\">Securing the Gases That Critical Industries Depend On</div>\n                    <p>\n                        AirLife supplies helium and other high-purity specialty gases used across healthcare, semiconductor manufacturing, aerospace, pharmaceuticals, and scientific research.\n                    </p>\n                    <p>\n                        Specialty gases are rarely visible to the end customer, but essential industries cannot function without them. Helium is irreplaceable in medical MRI imaging, chip fabrication, and aerospace. The global supply chain, however, is concentrated and subject to price shocks.\n                    </p>\n                    <p>\n                        AirLife is building the sourcing, processing, and distribution capabilities needed to make this supply dependable. The founders bring substantial gas industry experience and a practical understanding of procurement, safety, and customer delivery. As India expands its electronics and healthcare capabilities, the need for reliable specialty gases will compound alongside them.\n                    </p>\n                    <div style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n                        <a href=\"https://airlifegases.com/india/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"gdas-btn gdas-btn-white gdas-btn-sm\">\n                            <span>Visit AirLife Gases</span>\n                            <span class=\"gdas-btn-icon\">Γåù</span>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </article>\n    </div>\n</section><